<hr local-id=3D"bd131919966d">
<h2 local-id=3D"dcc8c2d40369" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-1.Introduction">1. Introduction</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"bdafc029b9a3" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-1.1Purpose">1.1 Purpose</h3>
<p local-id=3D"924a19356d38">This Software Requirements Specification (SRS)=
 defines the complete functional and non-functional requirements for the <s=
trong>USAV Solutions Unified ERP System</strong>. It is the authoritative t=
echnical specification that bridges the Business Requirements Document (BRD=
) and the system implementation. Every requirement stated herein is directl=
y traceable to a business objective.</p>
<p local-id=3D"da7dfd4948ff">This document governs:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"30563a47bee3">
<li local-id=3D"c044f49a153c">
<p local-id=3D"22ab3ff1ee5b">What the system shall do (functional requireme=
nts)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"59f5244018d8">
<p local-id=3D"089ec180072b">How well it shall do it (non-functional requir=
ements)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ee66aa5b69e2">
<p local-id=3D"18a3a84482c6">What data structures it shall use (data requir=
ements =E2=80=93 sourced directly from the production codebase)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5044385c2a8d">
<p local-id=3D"1ba8a9872d09">How it shall integrate with external systems (=
interface requirements)</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"fd6e42223fd3" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-1.2DocumentConventions">1.2 Document Conventions</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"07=
093cb8e460" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7e192a86892a">
<th data-local-id=3D"269a8aaed3af" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0f2420688c14">Convention</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"810965b6ccf2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a379bc96b632">Meaning</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4214ef773053">
<td data-local-id=3D"f2c607b807f2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d61dade07eae"><strong>SHALL</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fb680336c9f6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f2c6f633ae2d">Mandatory requirement. Must be implemented.</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c482bf901bcd">
<td data-local-id=3D"9afdf18c726c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f1d56595f837"><strong>SHOULD</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d52abe7f3c7d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"047cf7dfa709">Recommended. Should be implemented unless ther=
e is a strong reason not to.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"272677bffc95">
<td data-local-id=3D"3c09d6ba0fea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6b4bc398b449"><strong>MAY</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3220f714fa2d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9cff535f7352">Optional. Implementation is at the discretion =
of the development team.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"44d6f907d952">
<td data-local-id=3D"9039b4f70eeb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3797151a080d"><code>REQ-XX-NNN</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"310b80432046" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"866883aa9b99">Unique requirement ID. XX =3D domain code, NNN=
 =3D sequence number.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"743c099f572f">
<td data-local-id=3D"696218e675de" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4fb7a67f3c4f"><code>UC-XX-NN</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"15cb93e55585" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"90533cd7a087">Unique use case ID.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"86102c903663">
<td data-local-id=3D"66a82e5985ab" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e9ce2d30b00c"><code>[P1]</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bae8f59985cc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d6aae0183654">Priority 1 =E2=80=93 Critical. System is incom=
plete without this.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ff92d4f1e056">
<td data-local-id=3D"d4de1d2fd0d5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c9cd06a3368b"><code>[P2]</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"883faa32ff0b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a0890cf213c6">Priority 2 =E2=80=93 High. Major business valu=
e.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4d3644613354">
<td data-local-id=3D"00c49986e811" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5253742b87e6"><code>[P3]</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a6b57def4561" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"53af371a200b">Priority 3 =E2=80=93 Medium. Useful but deferr=
able.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"58cd1b1ea34e">
<td data-local-id=3D"68c19b18a23f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d12f04fe392a"><code>[P4]</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4c75c58fcf4d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"820dac3c4777">Priority 4 =E2=80=93 Low. Nice to have.</p></t=
d>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"967d014219ca">
<td data-local-id=3D"b7a40792634c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"17bd6c7d51fe"><code>{column_name}</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9931cf3a3436" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"71fb3fc87ee0">Refers to an actual database column in the pro=
duction schema.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
