<h3 local-id=3D"c56168f5ca60" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-1.4ProductScope">1.4 Product Scope</h3>
<p local-id=3D"0100a222d953"><strong>Product Name</strong>: USAV Solutions =
Unified ERP System</p>
<p local-id=3D"c73a420fd0d4"><strong>Product Description</strong>: A full-s=
tack enterprise resource planning platform purpose-built for USAV Solutions=
, a US-based e-commerce retailer specializing in used and refurbished Bose =
and home audio products. The system integrates all operational domains =E2=
=80=94 warehouse, purchasing, order management, listing management across 5=
 sales channels, customer support, CCTV evidence management, and marketing =
operations =E2=80=94 into a single unified data model.</p>
<p local-id=3D"958d17271eb3"><strong>Business Objectives Supported</strong>=
:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"28880a7a5278">
<li local-id=3D"6e31ffa55473">
<p local-id=3D"154965013d5a">Reduce order processing time by automating SKU=
 matching from platform listing data.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b98847725ee3">
<p local-id=3D"5e8bb7e798ff">Eliminate stock discrepancies through a ledger=
-based inventory model with real-time multi-channel sync.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"48fe44346671">
<p local-id=3D"15c902994a96">Provide irrefutable packing evidence via CCTV =
timestamp linking to protect against fraudulent claims.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"113e1242b088">
<p local-id=3D"82d1d2457b59">Centralize multi-account marketplace managemen=
t (3 eBay accounts, multiple Amazon seller IDs).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"488b01b1914a">
<p local-id=3D"36a12bb6fb8c">Enable margin visibility from purchase order c=
ost basis through to realized sale price.</p></li>
</ul>
