<hr local-id=3D"8d57574d5155">
<h2 local-id=3D"e70599da2109" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-2.OverallDescription">2. Overall Description</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"cfa02bf19e59" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-2.1ProductPerspective">2.1 Product Perspective</h3>
<p local-id=3D"be268938a0d9">The USAV Solutions ERP replaces a fragmented c=
ollection of spreadsheets, standalone Zoho Inventory records, and manually =
managed marketplace dashboards. It is a new, purpose-built system =E2=80=94=
 not a modification of an existing commercial ERP.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f69244d0eb67">The system consists of two primary subsystems =
that will be unified:</p>
<p local-id=3D"2ee4d90f2460"><strong>Subsystem A =E2=80=93 Core Catalog &am=
p; Order Engine (Project 09.ERP)</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"4099853c845f">
<li local-id=3D"e77d5184b262">
<p local-id=3D"01d4b9473d3c">Technology: Python 3.11 / FastAPI + PostgreSQL=
 + SQLAlchemy</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"52696e974403">
<p local-id=3D"68fafa06b448">Responsibility: Master product catalog (UPIS-H=
 / SKU system), order ingestion from all platforms, Zoho sync, inventory it=
em tracking, customer records.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"66a6c57dbf1a">
<p local-id=3D"f9b3a39a2861">Deployment: Docker Compose (API + PostgreSQL +=
 Redis)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"a050348d117a"><strong>Subsystem B =E2=80=93 Warehouse Operat=
ions Portal (Project 10.USAV-Orders-Backend-main)</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"15907e718660">
<li local-id=3D"2e8bdfa441ec">
<p local-id=3D"7034448c51ba">Technology: Next.js 14 / TypeScript + PostgreS=
QL (Neon) + Drizzle ORM</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"95706e98f9a7">
<p local-id=3D"a44cad37b89d">Responsibility: Multi-tenant warehouse station=
 UIs (Receiving, Tech, Packing), staff authentication (PIN + SSO), CCTV tim=
estamp logging, eBay/Amazon account management, purchasing workflows, custo=
mer support inbox.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f63de3a39f3a">
<p local-id=3D"fc57fe3dddf4">Deployment: Vercel + Neon Serverless PostgreSQ=
L</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"80f0c1d50de9"><strong>Integration Architecture</strong>: Hub=
 &amp; Spoke</p>
