<h3 local-id=3D"0283f6cc3333" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-2.5DesignandImplementationConstraints">2.5 Design and Implementation Cons=
traints</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"385a007d7399">
<li local-id=3D"2024b3fbfe64">
<p local-id=3D"1265f7183850"><strong>Data Immutability</strong>: The <code>=
{hex_signature}</code> and <code>{generated_upis_h}</code> columns on <code=
>product_identity</code> are immutable after row creation. No migration or =
application code shall overwrite them.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b74e732371fa">
<p local-id=3D"47e1a0d1cb8d"><strong>Idempotent Order Ingestion</strong>: T=
he <code>UNIQUE(platform, external_order_id)</code> constraint on the <code=
>orders</code> table enforces idempotency. Duplicate order imports must be =
silently ignored, never raise a 500 error.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"78054e77c15c">
<p local-id=3D"c907dc1bca5b"><strong>Ledger-Based Inventory</strong>: Stock=
 levels must never be set by direct quantity overwrite. All mutations flow =
through signed delta entries.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b1548bbe6e25">
<p local-id=3D"4fe9ffd918ca"><strong>Credential Encryption</strong>: All OA=
uth access tokens and refresh tokens (<code>{access_token}</code>, <code>{r=
efresh_token}</code> columns) must be stored encrypted at rest using AES-25=
6-GCM. Plaintext tokens must never be persisted.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"131ade8a3424">
<p local-id=3D"39cf92b4fa8a"><strong>Multi-Tenancy (Portal)</strong>: All t=
ables in the Warehouse Portal schema include an <code>{organization_id}</co=
de> UUID column enforced by Row-Level Security (RLS) at the PostgreSQL laye=
r. Application code must never bypass RLS.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"246ca9633cd8">
<p local-id=3D"37b283ad67f1"><strong>Schema Compatibility</strong>: The Fas=
tAPI ERP and Next.js Portal currently use separate PostgreSQL databases. In=
tegration is via shared API contracts =E2=80=94 not shared database connect=
ions. Any future unification requires a formal migration plan.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"422ba963906d">
<p local-id=3D"4b8eea62189b"><strong>Platform Policy Compliance</strong>: A=
ll marketplace API usage must comply with eBay Developer Agreement, Amazon =
SP-API acceptable use policy, and Shopify API Terms of Service.</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"4e592e0a12d8" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-2.6AssumptionsandDependencies">2.6 Assumptions and Dependencies</h3>
<p local-id=3D"72a3142e2344"><strong>Assumptions</strong>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7da00789f868">
<li local-id=3D"3479cde1fa3b">
<p local-id=3D"25e3468a073e">Each physical packing station has a dedicated =
CCTV camera with a unique NVR channel ID.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bb0dd24a06f2">
<p local-id=3D"b6a95cd12e60">The Synology NAS is accessible via network URL=
 for photo retrieval (referenced in <code>packing_metadata</code> JSONB).</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"424771011240">
<p local-id=3D"9ca173a468e3">All marketplace seller accounts already exist;=
 the ERP manages credentials, not account registration.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9e472bbc0c8f">
<p local-id=3D"348cca53223d">Zoho Inventory organization is already provisi=
oned; the ERP syncs to it, does not replace it.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ba088ab2dff8"><strong>Dependencies</strong>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"6d3e02b22594">
<li local-id=3D"2cbaf5281d6a">
<p local-id=3D"98d2c4cbc8c7">Amazon SP-API LWA tokens (Login with Amazon OA=
uth 2.0)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"71544de72d0a">
<p local-id=3D"74a0cc31d80a">eBay OAuth 2.0 per-account refresh tokens for =
EBAY_MEKONG, EBAY_USAV, EBAY_DRAGON accounts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bdb2a887ada8">
<p local-id=3D"bc59b80b487d">Shopify Private App or OAuth App credentials</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"16d3e05b787e">
<p local-id=3D"93469ceeed7d">Ecwid Store ID + Secret Token</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"974b8b68aabc">
<p local-id=3D"b8765f0270af">Walmart Client ID + Client Secret</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"968e31565e7d">
<p local-id=3D"05c60bfde906">Zoho Inventory OAuth 2.0 organization token</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"cd3c5cfe7619">
<p local-id=3D"0e04babb4ef6">UPS, USPS, FedEx carrier API credentials for l=
abel generation</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"df68597e7a0f">
<h2 local-id=3D"9c625afda4f1" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.SpecificRequirements=E2=80=93Functional">3. Specific Requirements =E2=
=80=93 Functional</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"74a95a3da27b" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.1SF-01:ProductManagement&amp;Catalog">3.1 SF-01: Product Management &am=
p; Catalog</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"42=
37d8808078" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5ba5848bdc20">
<th data-local-id=3D"db5652df0184" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"692b705d8d41">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"e75d85e97c4f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"84344ca9cc5d">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"25a6e1bf2aa9">
<td data-local-id=3D"6e114a8c3531" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"67971939c128"><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d007354a5936" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a5658a781fa9">[P1] Critical</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"64d7d7481732">
<td data-local-id=3D"2f53da79abc6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cb18ad5a473b"><strong>Source Models</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e9f48f7d98c2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dfaecc6f4665"><code>product_family</code>, <code>product_ide=
ntity</code>, <code>product_variant</code>, <code>bundle_component</code>, =
<code>lci_definition</code>, <code>brand</code>, <code>color</code>, <code>=
condition</code></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"272e55f9cbd6"><strong>Overview</strong>: The system implemen=
ts a two-layer product identification model. Layer 1 is the engineering ide=
ntity (what an item IS, defined by the UPIS-H signature). Layer 2 is the sa=
les variant (how it is SOLD, defined by color and condition).</p>
<h4 local-id=3D"ffbf85473138" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.1.1FunctionalRequirements">3.1.1 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"8f=
e72883f058" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cd218172a470">
<th data-local-id=3D"91ffe46a8aaf" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"50e82d8e378b">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"9a890b6f0782" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"08d361a4121e">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"227a39612022" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"83081e142377">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b040986b77bc">
<td data-local-id=3D"ffefad025dfa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"62a043bddfe9">REQ-CAT-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f10dd54e107e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e9e9a8da85f4">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e068c0c97f43" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a196e7ad4e74">System SHALL maintain a <code>product_family</=
code> table keyed by 5-digit ECWID product ID (<code>{product_id}</code>). =
Family codes must be zero-padded (e.g., <code>00845</code>).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7c7ddad41e8a">
<td data-local-id=3D"27dbde5c55b6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2f00f6ae518a">REQ-CAT-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"22eb75b83a3b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"de37e06e7a4a">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"643700b4f41b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a55251567009">System SHALL generate a <code>generated_upis_h=
</code> string (e.g., <code>00845-P-1</code>) for each <code>product_identi=
ty</code> row. This field is IMMUTABLE after row creation.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6c0fec88345a">
<td data-local-id=3D"72b7d0fafca2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bb3babea37b3">REQ-CAT-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ffd6d35ec691" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6c67404e67a5">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e2c0a84fcdc8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b71018a3129d">System SHALL encode a <code>{hex_signature}</c=
ode> (32-bit HEX, 8 characters) on each identity. This field is IMMUTABLE a=
nd acts as the compact unique key.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c8d626dd0b22">
<td data-local-id=3D"d354300e7741" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e3b509809f55">REQ-CAT-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5bdc5d2b59bd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"facfda38dbb7">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1860dce644ac" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"168230050e95">System SHALL support four identity types: <cod=
e>Product</code> (standard), <code>B</code> (Bundle), <code>P</code> (Part/=
Component), <code>K</code> (Kit).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d99ebbabe162">
<td data-local-id=3D"b525fcf2fe1b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bc97801570db">REQ-CAT-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4065b969f05a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"200ac3db6ffc">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"34aa37c20d23" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cf5e9e2e1ca1">System SHALL enforce <code>{lci}</code> (Local=
 Component Index, 1=E2=80=9399) as NOT NULL only when <code>{type}</code> =
=3D <code>P</code>. For all other types it must be NULL (enforced by <code>=
ck_identity_lci_type_constraint</code>).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e66975ee328f">
<td data-local-id=3D"8355cda84ba1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ac375f15e3a">REQ-CAT-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7b627241ee11" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eb79b7c90702">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"77c174f492b3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a60fa17902d5">System SHALL generate a unique <code>{full_sku=
}</code> for each <code>product_variant</code> row (e.g., <code>00845-P-1-W=
Y-N</code>) composed of: UPIS-H + color code + condition code.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"45ad95e16579">
<td data-local-id=3D"5b6d8ccd2176" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0b2cd81d1423">REQ-CAT-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"721d4b577b7b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"392cb6e4fb49">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0cd8438bb15d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4b336e40997c">System SHALL enforce uniqueness of variant per=
 identity=C3=97color=C3=97condition triple via <code>uq_variant_identity_co=
lor_condition</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d292d9e074fa">
<td data-local-id=3D"a4c8f9469991" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"904fb32efb60">REQ-CAT-008</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1b5771bc7e3c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f64c907a1101">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9afc818fe3ab" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e8db0a060cfb">System SHALL support soft-deletion of variants=
 via <code>{is_active}</code> =3D false. Soft-deleted variants must not app=
ear in listing or order matching lookups.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2a026bc15950">
<td data-local-id=3D"443cab52d41a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ac35d4a28ac">REQ-CAT-009</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"428886a44b4c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37d7cb6552cb">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"92e05c74d31c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ae6987d2b758">System SHALL maintain a <code>bundle_component=
</code> Bill-of-Materials table. A bundle cannot reference itself (<code>ck=
_bundle_no_self_reference</code>). Quantity must be positive (<code>ck_bund=
le_positive_quantity</code>).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7f9ab9955ca1">
<td data-local-id=3D"691709f9d014" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f0082e24c9bf">REQ-CAT-010</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"88aa00cb4605" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7cd82d0059fa">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0d8558479fb5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b0cf28af00d9">System SHALL maintain <code>lci_definition</co=
de> rows that map LCI index numbers to component names per product family.<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"13ddbb5a7c85">
<td data-local-id=3D"4c2079442cce" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ec15bd25d8b6">REQ-CAT-011</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c2b0dbb353fd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"01e1ee9c2140">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f0a5d5faf975" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da300aa32d8f">System SHALL store physical dimensions (<code>=
{dimension_length}</code>, <code>{dimension_width}</code>, <code>{dimension=
_height}</code> in inches) and <code>{weight}</code> (in pounds) on product=
 identities.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a1f626bdcabe">
<td data-local-id=3D"6bdf534a443a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bb47939ede1a">REQ-CAT-012</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c86e14aa9970" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"460c635dbb1f">[P3]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f2a483e72833" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6a74b37f86c4">System SHALL support <code>{is_stationery}</co=
de> flag. Stationery identities must be of type <code>Product</code> and ma=
y only have a single variant.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"dcefac03c90f" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.1.2UseCases">3.1.2 Use Cases</h4>
<h5 local-id=3D"87a86e3c64ff" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-UseCaseUC-CAT-01:CreateaNewProductFamilyandIdentity">Use Case UC-CAT-01: =
Create a New Product Family and Identity</h5>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"7d=
552515ac1b" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"503707518b0e">
<th data-local-id=3D"2544b6b57ad2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"825e51396978">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"608498c1be79" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"cfad44e7f4ce">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"679dcefc6b08">
<td data-local-id=3D"273d233d3e2d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c9c101141a6c"><strong>Use Case ID</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7f8c5c483189" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37c2cb523f2b">UC-CAT-01</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"74ff366c1115">
<td data-local-id=3D"18620236af9d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bace78f19c23"><strong>Actor(s)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7e8f2b2eaaea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b034117097b">Listing Manager / Data Admin</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"edbdf38aa466">
<td data-local-id=3D"f9cf94c1bb3a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4cb90ca98f0e"><strong>Preconditions</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b49a2f6a6134" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d99ede42fc66">Admin is authenticated.; The ECWID product ID =
for the new product is known.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"30638eb4b492">
<td data-local-id=3D"4d69ac24db10" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6d8b57f06850"><strong>Postconditions</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ec45fdaa5188" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d072029053fd">New <code>product_family</code>, <code>product=
_identity</code>, and <code>product_variant</code> rows created. Zoho sync =
queued.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"9597e9a066c5"><strong>Basic Flow:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"7634f94d9b7b">
<li local-id=3D"597cbf6eb781">
<p local-id=3D"40536e3af6f7">Admin navigates to Catalog =E2=86=92 New Produ=
ct.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2d28d4f6d7ac">
<p local-id=3D"542432560a2c">Admin enters the 5-digit ECWID product ID (whi=
ch becomes <code>{product_id}</code>).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dd55938526fa">
<p local-id=3D"87f6da039346">Admin enters the base name (e.g., "Bose SoundL=
ink Revolve") and optional description.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7a8f8d7ff8aa">
<p local-id=3D"af9e6b3215ac">Admin selects brand from the <code>brand</code=
> lookup table.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a2aca4a7b174">
<p local-id=3D"025d92b599dc">System creates the <code>product_family</code>=
 row and auto-generates <code>{family_code}</code> (zero-padded <code>produ=
ct_id</code>).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a91178a17078">
<p local-id=3D"e4006d9563ac">Admin selects identity type (Product, Bundle, =
Part, Kit) and physical class.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9e87bc45a7ab">
<p local-id=3D"004bcc85b241">If type=3DPart: Admin enters the LCI index (1=
=E2=80=9399).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1900e146b08b">
<p local-id=3D"42aed935e514">System computes <code>{generated_upis_h}</code=
> and <code>{hex_signature}</code> and creates the <code>product_identity</=
code> row.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"087954784287">
<p local-id=3D"8e218e60d26b">System displays the newly created UPIS-H and p=
rompts admin to create the first variant.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d0dd6eebd115">
<p local-id=3D"f372add36dff">Admin selects color and condition codes. Syste=
m creates the <code>product_variant</code> and generates <code>{full_sku}</=
code>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dbb15185d925">
<p local-id=3D"f301e2ca2578">System sets <code>{zoho_sync_status}</code> =
=3D PENDING on the new variant. Zoho sync job will pick it up.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"f11d0fe01e3d"><strong>Exception Flows:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"0ab768085265">
<li local-id=3D"49273aadf5e2">
<p local-id=3D"024b4b503ae0">Product ID already exists: System returns vali=
dation error. Admin must use the existing family.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a4857231303e">
<p local-id=3D"864e394312c1">Identity type =3D Part but LCI not provided: S=
ystem rejects form with validation message.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"77cf42da3054" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.2SF-02:WarehouseReceiving">3.2 SF-02: Warehouse Receiving</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"2d=
064714c1dd" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"45af0ddb574b">
<th data-local-id=3D"658bf9f50650" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4a192ab87330">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a470839bcb5e" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"55de8080bf3f">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8c42d1c38b0d">
<td data-local-id=3D"97e308f6645a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c97f31a16c67"><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2f7ff23fb858" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bbd142bd1df8">[P1] Critical</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6a9784b2011b">
<td data-local-id=3D"4dd185e4a672" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"44ba38baf02f"><strong>Source Models</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"47f3328f6500" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c0387643b17"><code>receiving_sessions</code> (schema.ts), <=
code>receiving_items</code> (schema.ts)</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"5f7940914155"><strong>Overview</strong>: The Receiving modul=
e manages all inbound inventory from suppliers, liquidation pallets, and cu=
stomer returns. Every physical unit entering the warehouse must be logged, =
assigned a lot ID, and have a GS1 barcode label printed before it moves to =
testing.</p>
<h4 local-id=3D"287f01d6712a" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.2.1FunctionalRequirements">3.2.1 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"1e=
4bb91eab16" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1e293dcf3fb0">
<th data-local-id=3D"bcbfd80ba6a7" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"27c4720a8136">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"f9b16b685282" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ffa374a4c249">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"2ced6d2cc42f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c5a352a11d15">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0f36845683f4">
<td data-local-id=3D"74642d3c3099" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fdc1270bb5cb">REQ-REC-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0643081cdcd1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9edc71635bcc">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"56abc18f6d3a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"14a1c7ab4d71">System SHALL allow receiving clerks to create =
a new receiving session with: source platform/account, type (Liquidation, e=
Bay Return, Direct Purchase), expected quantity, and reference number.</p><=
/td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a297f1154096">
<td data-local-id=3D"12200a9be202" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ed86383fa924">REQ-REC-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f78776d46d78" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9e82384e5c48">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9300bd3aa903" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d1de1ff50454">System SHALL auto-generate a unique lot ID for=
 each receiving session.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"99f5afe81997">
<td data-local-id=3D"c3e725936a33" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"028e0dbbcf15">REQ-REC-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1802cba7ed9d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"68dfa2470189">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"73da3df1723c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f8bff7fdced8">System SHALL print a GS1-128 compliant barcode=
 label for each receiving session/lot upon confirmation.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f40f131fa8fa">
<td data-local-id=3D"0c393be5bb4c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3bb92645e08d">REQ-REC-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a60435ec8a96" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"10fd399a9a95">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f5c5f6655a9a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cf7e1b3cbb95">System SHALL allow photo attachment to receivi=
ng sessions (photos stored as URLs in the session record referencing Synolo=
gy NAS or S3).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e3374de7053c">
<td data-local-id=3D"bd14921269de" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9aa6dcc5d7f7">REQ-REC-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"163ff6ddacbf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ff7ca62e0994">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0af72558f60a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"57cee2f9fd59">System SHALL support receiving session types i=
ncluding: regular inbound, eBay returns, customer returns. The <code>{is_re=
turn}</code> flag on the <code>types</code> table distinguishes return flow=
s.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cb9ee0a42e31">
<td data-local-id=3D"53484a080698" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d3f47781cecc">REQ-REC-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"14166fd70f76" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ca5926f5e43">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"68b676d8504b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e85a523afa4d">System SHALL allow assignment of incoming item=
s to a storage zone / bin location.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4bafdd60cbef">
<td data-local-id=3D"58b262bb80b9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"de03b66fd5bf">REQ-REC-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"14d941ad375b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d2da31802877">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4549f6d02992" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"abc8ffc1bfee">System SHALL flag sessions where no matching P=
urchase Order exists as "Unplanned Receiving" and notify the Purchasing Age=
nt.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9e8aec2f5004">
<td data-local-id=3D"0f30383177a7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"115fe021b6a5">REQ-REC-008</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"18f03248c9cc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bfa903b5eb8e">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"df79a9db9649" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"45a5a91576ec">System SHALL support partial reception =E2=80=
=94 marking some items received while the session remains open for addition=
al arrivals.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"57013754f732">
<td data-local-id=3D"1f86b571e0a4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c7fcd5090758">REQ-REC-009</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7e799a859099" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3097dc332c29">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2da2daaa1639" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ea4074dd9887">System SHALL log the receiving clerk staff ID =
and timestamp for each session create/update event.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"54b71d87fd02" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.2.2UseCases">3.2.2 Use Cases</h4>
<h5 local-id=3D"ae36717a6dc4" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-UseCaseUC-REC-01:LoganInboundLiquidationPallet">Use Case UC-REC-01: Log a=
n Inbound Liquidation Pallet</h5>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"9f=
fac4509700" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3a36f37dd499">
<th data-local-id=3D"f6c73b21b1ea" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"003241786484">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"53c5598a45ab" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7040c197ef3c">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e58917a9a704">
<td data-local-id=3D"4daddd4e2850" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aeb5fd005d4d"><strong>Use Case ID</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b9ceb8c5ef8f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8766b2830bd4">UC-REC-01</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"634219232b6b">
<td data-local-id=3D"37eeb9296b21" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"393f74dc838d"><strong>Actor(s)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"757976fb4889" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"83e6d00eb340">Receiving Clerk</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9df24ad6120d">
<td data-local-id=3D"6ae2afe8361c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"52c20c37a7ea"><strong>Preconditions</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8dcabc73150c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e5c96abf94c0">Clerk is authenticated at the receiving statio=
n.; Delivery carrier has arrived with a pallet.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2777497f17f0">
<td data-local-id=3D"14a876b38afd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6bb9f9a040ec"><strong>Postconditions</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"18795ce73d1c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d0bcf8ee2933">Receiving session created. Lot barcode printed=
. Items status =3D IN_RECEIVING.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"a752a515d433"><strong>Basic Flow:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"bc419866506f">
<li local-id=3D"83428468cb02">
<p local-id=3D"9de164e90399">Clerk selects "New Receiving Session" on the r=
eceiving station UI.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ac165c608809">
<p local-id=3D"403f1d08e699">Clerk selects the Source Platform (e.g., BULQ)=
 and Account.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"23eb8e6fbc3e">
<p local-id=3D"9a8a6f3ebdf9">Clerk selects the type "Liquidation Pallet" (s=
ourced from <code>types</code> catalog).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1e25ba18aedd">
<p local-id=3D"78d66c27f0ac">Clerk enters the carrier tracking number and p=
arcel count.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"82669ec763ce">
<p local-id=3D"8ace42efc242">Clerk takes and uploads a photo of the pallet =
(stored to NAS, URL saved to session).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"38be0e5d675b">
<p local-id=3D"6b63ee408cc8">System auto-generates a lot ID and triggers GS=
1 label printing.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"27c3a4db1ef3">
<p local-id=3D"799021ba8280">Clerk confirms. System saves session and statu=
s =3D IN_RECEIVING.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7cd3436142f6">
<p local-id=3D"86f2e4b5215f">If a Purchase Order exists: System auto-links =
the session to the PO.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"12b068a6b790"><strong>Exception Flows:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"cfd06a3fac4d">
<li local-id=3D"5907fcfad22e">
<p local-id=3D"7d8888bacf4a">No matching PO found: System marks session as =
"Unplanned" and alerts purchasing.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"82ad5cb86bff">
<p local-id=3D"3ff4747620dc">Label printer offline: System queues label job=
 and displays tracking number for manual label creation.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"4d7020016b72" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.3SF-03:DiagnosticTesting&amp;Grading">3.3 SF-03: Diagnostic Testing &am=
p; Grading</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"77=
fe506a5d43" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ab51c1693fe9">
<th data-local-id=3D"a9c166a85f63" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d8c8616e9a46">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"deff20c8bccc" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5b80757521e5">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2773c4ac92d8">
<td data-local-id=3D"0277e734731b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2c65ed1c2a3e"><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ac566d3a518f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a3d0c519c26a">[P1] Critical</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d98d82447b69">
<td data-local-id=3D"27a2334bdb7b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"be29e752237e"><strong>Source Models</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2e39b81622a9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"369ddaa0bb34"><code>tech_sessions</code> (schema.ts), <code>=
inventory_item</code> (entities.py)</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"594bbc834350" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.3.1FunctionalRequirements">3.3.1 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"68=
b339fbb626" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"66aa491ccfdc">
<th data-local-id=3D"9d50bd44fefa" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"3ad818c71fb2">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"7e4c241b0eac" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"aa97a6f3ffe5">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"fb2616d617dc" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5463a1c176a6">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2f5a5f8bd808">
<td data-local-id=3D"fc7551da1f19" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9e8457dcf6f7">REQ-TECH-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f5c2244b047d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"560a4e28268b">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d2c5aeec92d9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ea4254e5b15">System SHALL provide per-product-model diagnos=
tic checklist templates. Each template contains ordered test steps specific=
 to that model (e.g., "Power On", "Bluetooth Pair", "CD Spin").</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"87cf51743afa">
<td data-local-id=3D"0e47ba48977f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7db3da179a1e">REQ-TECH-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"387e61cdf774" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"192b6c334122">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b78a8ab57bfb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"382627854442">System SHALL require technicians to mark every=
 checklist step as Pass, Fail, or N/A before a diagnostic session can be su=
bmitted.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e1e0b5f4e0e5">
<td data-local-id=3D"2f024416d193" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cf177cd2b696">REQ-TECH-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"df1aade5dd80" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"053defc8402f">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5d0b58c92b9c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d4b3f78ed964">System SHALL assign a cosmetic condition grade=
 (A, B, C, D) to each unit. Grade D routes the unit to the Parts Salvage bi=
n automatically.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d11eaeac0bc8">
<td data-local-id=3D"c71247cbfce0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7d3a3c94c395">REQ-TECH-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"24e7c45a6a94" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37d441d6711e">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"39d4dc0f6b1a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4724e92371de">System SHALL capture the manufacturer serial n=
umber in <code>{serial_number}</code> on the <code>inventory_item</code> re=
cord. If unreadable, technician must flag as "Serial Defaced" and system no=
tes it in <code>{notes}</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"63ba115a684d">
<td data-local-id=3D"fa54580a2c7f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6360488474bd">REQ-TECH-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e22c290293c3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3cad7980ce75">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f0566b7f342f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0fd29fa17524">System SHALL set <code>{status}</code> =3D <co=
de>AVAILABLE</code> on the <code>inventory_item</code> upon successful diag=
nostic completion (Grade A, B, or C with all steps Pass/N/A).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"68c1c9f46766">
<td data-local-id=3D"de3065e27c7d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e1613fcace78">REQ-TECH-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0f5579d28efb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"349f796cf586">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"260e0f320df7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"485a78de290a">System SHALL set <code>{status}</code> =3D <co=
de>DAMAGED</code> if the item fails critical diagnostic steps.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"023d3927a19c">
<td data-local-id=3D"4ef97c9434f2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"721c718b6f95">REQ-TECH-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"654e9b09f535" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a89c28a0a0fb">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7e010dfa9f59" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ed5afcc12b2">System SHALL record <code>{received_at}</code>=
 timestamp on <code>inventory_item</code> upon first diagnostic session cre=
ation.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"80413f0f03b1">
<td data-local-id=3D"3b2d3f030dab" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"24b39f8b7532">REQ-TECH-008</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"962abf4525a3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9ff179de8ad9">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"72ee2e355afd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1ca3755b7c88">System SHALL link the diagnosed unit to the or=
iginating receiving session lot ID for traceability.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"53a5eca12600">
<td data-local-id=3D"e3923ac57dd3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c23c4b1fac21">REQ-TECH-009</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"be949fd4a75e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f5de4508258e">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3f7057144dcb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"361291f5e267">System SHALL display the parts compatibility l=
ist for the product model being tested.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c1af0da278f1">
<td data-local-id=3D"de72f91de7e1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f0e427598516">REQ-TECH-010</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"781509ed5d85" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"29640b8f70af">[P3]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6fdddea92b50" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"649a80aff220">System SHALL allow free-text failure mode note=
s to be captured in the <code>{notes}</code> column.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"5839fed44b28" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.4SF-04:InventoryManagement">3.4 SF-04: Inventory Management</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"05=
f734b4bde4" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ed3586dccaf8">
<th data-local-id=3D"b189ea0a9584" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"cd3b32ce82ef">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"08adcb852465" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"38182dcfea7d">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"660237b45e51">
<td data-local-id=3D"016840edc19c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"670ea5653e62"><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f4a88007bfc9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2a40877f646f">[P1] Critical</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ccd18184a866">
<td data-local-id=3D"a03ad22694a4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bfe2076047bb"><strong>Source Models</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5bb02133c310" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5ed1ed08ddac"><code>inventory_item</code> (entities.py): id,=
 serial_number, variant_id, status, location_code, cost_basis, notes, recei=
ved_at, sold_at</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"49b90895c7fa" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.4.1FunctionalRequirements">3.4.1 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"e6=
45c7e19e85" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"641485de320a">
<th data-local-id=3D"65c41b138873" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5c6fb7b4c549">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"9610203f3d5c" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"1d3a3cf456eb">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"9694aa3b7023" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8eba9692f6a2">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"252f2688e118">
<td data-local-id=3D"e918f8c55491" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"62e181923ba8">REQ-INV-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5fdd6ce48d6a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"04e969aac7a5">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cb04b55e2130" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"58db8719e2a7">Each <code>inventory_item</code> row represent=
s ONE physical serialized unit. Aggregations (available count per SKU) are =
derived queries, never stored columns.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4ba598f8e2db">
<td data-local-id=3D"f2859aeb4697" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ceb80d78109d">REQ-INV-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"be0ffca72d17" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ba1590595a45">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cb588d9f4d90" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9aacd4d695ff"><code>{status}</code> field SHALL follow the l=
ifecycle: <code>AVAILABLE</code> =E2=86=92 <code>RESERVED</code> =E2=86=92 =
<code>SOLD</code>. Allowed values: <code>AVAILABLE</code>, <code>SOLD</code=
>, <code>RESERVED</code>, <code>RMA</code>, <code>DAMAGED</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7b53dff312da">
<td data-local-id=3D"04ac1ef223d1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"211b47f60404">REQ-INV-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"836511340cc0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5897b114b6b0">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"db62ea09db94" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b678faf53c39">System SHALL track <code>{location_code}</code=
> (warehouse bin, e.g., "A1-S2") for every unit that is AVAILABLE or RESERV=
ED.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3034898e3a79">
<td data-local-id=3D"66f9c3b5fc8b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8945dea0b05c">REQ-INV-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1c7623752261" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d7fbc57f5ddb">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a25ae1647e2c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7fb172fdbb1e">System SHALL record <code>{cost_basis}</code> =
(Numeric 10,2) for each unit, derived from the linked PO cost-per-unit. Mus=
t satisfy <code>cost_basis &gt;=3D 0</code> (<code>ck_inventory_positive_co=
st</code>).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f998791ff637">
<td data-local-id=3D"c35bb6a8cb99" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c1b2a234fa57">REQ-INV-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"33bb2624de9e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d30416a7bd83">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e5b6a5faa1d0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2a8af6f63566">System SHALL set <code>{sold_at}</code> timest=
amp when a unit status transitions to SOLD.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e8f7c5c73440">
<td data-local-id=3D"1bc4693cbde9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fc8455b2597d">REQ-INV-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e31b50ca60d1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ff75914f1bd5">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c163334a5e5b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c32d840bb3da">System SHALL support a cycle count campaign wo=
rkflow: select a bin, scan all units present, flag discrepancies against ex=
pected units.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d6ae40be8abf">
<td data-local-id=3D"30602e05f5e0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"517370fcb8d8">REQ-INV-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8de10ea7a24d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f950772d6666">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"81fd2ea0420a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1f3c573647f1">System SHALL allow bulk status update of units=
 from a receiving lot to a diagnostic queue.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ffd983dbf973">
<td data-local-id=3D"791c4ea12daf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"48989f378292">REQ-INV-008</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1e15957f88a2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"89af38b232c1">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b9af07793336" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"85816c9a2e15">System SHALL compute and display per-SKU avail=
ability count as: COUNT(inventory_item WHERE variant_id=3DX AND status=3DAV=
AILABLE).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f36d719a2b52">
<td data-local-id=3D"747a99931ed0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b3222b14c2b1">REQ-INV-009</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"687c67fc5f45" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4d7ddcd60da3">[P3]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"34c34f3ba30c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"caeee0f83724">System SHALL store additional technician notes=
 in <code>{notes}</code> (TEXT, nullable).</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"675a10394f8a" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.5SF-05:Packing&amp;Dispatch">3.5 SF-05: Packing &amp; Dispatch</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"10=
30ad96f119" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"05549020ce34">
<th data-local-id=3D"c0ea8ef3325c" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"239555c26c15">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"c9072d855f56" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9ad45ca2aeb5">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9ee1dc95ff7b">
<td data-local-id=3D"85ceaf80f101" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9d9901f5c463"><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"50e46e10f397" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b53c943d977b">[P1] Critical</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d0274a4146c4">
<td data-local-id=3D"9e0f70a2f62f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6dea6f111fc7"><strong>Source Models</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c4498de01303" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"19d444bf7b25"><code>packer_logs</code> (schema.ts), <code>ph=
ysical_scans</code> (orders/models.py), <code>orders.shipping_status</code>=
, <code>orders.tracking_number</code>, <code>orders.carrier</code></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"b85e69814e70" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.5.1FunctionalRequirements">3.5.1 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"4d=
9cf9093aa9" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7f80f77a64cb">
<th data-local-id=3D"42710247cecd" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d382e907f0be">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"d65f86937e88" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9836b995c2e1">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"43bb8ad4f668" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b656ed52c211">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bc0be3038345">
<td data-local-id=3D"da5a924e0d99" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"01d8f330903e">REQ-PACK-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6449cb5d9e26" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aed73f71c844">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4dc29c168290" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8289808b326d">System SHALL require packer to scan the order =
pick-slip barcode to open a packing session.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3e40c3d224e0">
<td data-local-id=3D"d10ecdf65f42" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"12bee68ce427">REQ-PACK-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f18d0094e0a5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"46ca00ef2ed2">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7ebd0b2da62b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a72c3bca14d0">System SHALL require packer to individually sc=
an each item barcode (inventory unit) before generating a shipping label. Q=
uantity must match order line item quantity.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fc95f3c5a0a5">
<td data-local-id=3D"4aba2c8390d9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9957322c9967">REQ-PACK-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ada9897435d7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"145b994a74e5">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f10595b85bdb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ef07af8eb07e">System SHALL block shipping label generation u=
ntil all expected items are confirmed via scan.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cb426ac7ecd6">
<td data-local-id=3D"670d42c56060" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bbcbc14fb7c5">REQ-PACK-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"befb666c87db" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9d3cefdfcf8b">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"15312438e6b9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e466e0263592">System SHALL log each packing session with: st=
aff ID (<code>{packer_id}</code>), start timestamp (<code>{started_at}</cod=
e>), completion timestamp (<code>{completed_at}</code>), order ID, station =
ID.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cb5401ef1bb2">
<td data-local-id=3D"229b83b6f389" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0d25149c8c0d">REQ-PACK-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3ab9dbe0148f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"860ef298c27f">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ff72bcdcd0da" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ee48b48df795">System SHALL record the CCTV camera ID (<code>=
{camera_id}</code>) and start/end UTC timestamps (<code>{cctv_start_ts}</co=
de>, <code>{cctv_end_ts}</code>) for each packing session in <code>packer_l=
ogs</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c28e6507d33c">
<td data-local-id=3D"ed9ef446b331" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"86ae63c707dd">REQ-PACK-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"968dbcdf6372" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"35b4d0d84e55">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6393bbb33505" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f95c1b8e2fb4">System SHALL record package weight from the co=
nnected postal scale in <code>{weight_grams}</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0f324acdf7e1">
<td data-local-id=3D"2166929dfebe" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a07091ff1e1a">REQ-PACK-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7a12b2a7113e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"94ed1b26e347">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fb635aef7552" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"19e2bb379b2a">System SHALL dispatch shipping label request t=
o UPS, USPS, or FedEx API based on <code>{carrier}</code> selected.</p></td=
>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"85f03ff18078">
<td data-local-id=3D"8ff1c01b44e2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b6efaca8b32d">REQ-PACK-008</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"00a2b91b2cea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"08472df481c9">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9570be48fb7a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3fcbff15e9c7">System SHALL update <code>orders.{tracking_num=
ber}</code>, <code>orders.{carrier}</code>, <code>orders.{shipping_status}<=
/code> =3D SHIPPING upon label generation.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0b28c23dbd98">
<td data-local-id=3D"166f2d95a9d3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a61de56d5b61">REQ-PACK-009</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3591b4172e2a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"70a05309fd5e">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"39d5dc4b96db" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a02ab1eca6fe">System SHALL update <code>inventory_item.{stat=
us}</code> =3D SOLD and set <code>{sold_at}</code> for each unit packed.</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c6ebd98c8493">
<td data-local-id=3D"cc942c4a7695" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"56f78f65c539">REQ-PACK-010</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c54d511ff39e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1eb19b097258">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6503fbeb877b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c7774a899cd2">System SHALL log each barcode scan event in <c=
ode>physical_scans</code>: tracking number, <code>{scanned_at}</code>, <cod=
e>{scanned_by}</code>, <code>{is_matched}</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"747a2c2b867c">
<td data-local-id=3D"545bd798a85c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e8f7d3dfc268">REQ-PACK-011</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"be11e31c1a62" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c57464216b2e">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8b6d8a2a58e2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"62e44cf9cdb7">System SHALL alert supervisor if package weigh=
t exceeds the catalog standard weight for the product by more than 15%.</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"eb58cbdc5cd6">
<td data-local-id=3D"98a957ea71c6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"69d042710e27">REQ-PACK-012</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ac1a177f4e61" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7c12e5ad6038">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"051cb98ca69f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8cd20e8b5a0f">System SHALL send automatic shipping confirmat=
ion to the customer via the origin platform API after label is generated.</=
p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"74174044397e" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.5.2UseCases">3.5.2 Use Cases</h4>
<h5 local-id=3D"d318fc2ed0a5" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-UseCaseUC-PACK-01:PackandShipaneBayOrder">Use Case UC-PACK-01: Pack and S=
hip an eBay Order</h5>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"f9=
26a6c3e991" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ec43d1939295">
<th data-local-id=3D"c3fa7a8bf3dd" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a5a3413ea9a6">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"8ceb8aa9f454" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8ef573ec044e">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e25d0e818377">
<td data-local-id=3D"1ad5def29059" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2ba19ae40f62"><strong>Use Case ID</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5825ae749002" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8faed6cf615">UC-PACK-01</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"29557e5f9767">
<td data-local-id=3D"1de7f19638eb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f1405f74dc78"><strong>Actor(s)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"112760fab47f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"410fb4ea1719">Warehouse Packer</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"698b3b2d6ee6">
<td data-local-id=3D"bedba93c66c7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ef38d247ca4c"><strong>Preconditions</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9cd6e0408493" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9392d6002ae0">Order <code>{status}</code> =3D PROCESSING and=
 <code>{shipping_status}</code> =3D PENDING.; Packer is authenticated at pa=
cking station.; CCTV camera is recording at the station.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2b39f14795c9">
<td data-local-id=3D"a481fd094e8f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0e958c36ec81"><strong>Postconditions</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"787168c0fbec" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ecea37d255fa">Packing session log saved with CCTV timestamps=
. Items SOLD. Order SHIPPING. Carrier tracking recorded.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"9681e0106582"><strong>Basic Flow:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"e1851cadfb62">
<li local-id=3D"9bd0d0e0dc28">
<p local-id=3D"6488bb24a60f">Packer scans the order pick-slip barcode. Syst=
em opens packing session; records <code>{cctv_start_ts}</code>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ae404742e3aa">
<p local-id=3D"87ee7bdaf57e">System displays the expected items list from <=
code>order_item</code> records.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e33f44389f70">
<p local-id=3D"d42c9ef6e294">Packer scans each item barcode one by one. Sys=
tem verifies each scan against <code>inventory_item.{serial_number}</code> =
or barcode.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4c357a324f60">
<p local-id=3D"13316348d2b4">All items confirmed. System prompts packer to =
weigh the package on the connected scale.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e154d5ae8be5">
<p local-id=3D"e94059d27bdc">System records <code>{weight_grams}</code>. Co=
mpares to catalog standard weight.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4e3e90800a42">
<p local-id=3D"cc00c9f1ff95">If weight OK: System generates carrier label v=
ia UPS/USPS API. Records <code>{cctv_end_ts}</code> and <code>{tracking_num=
ber}</code>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"10275502e33a">
<p local-id=3D"d4571be11af4">Packer prints label, affixes to package, place=
s in dispatch queue.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b811b8661787">
<p local-id=3D"ed8edcfe9e10">System sets <code>orders.{shipping_status}</co=
de> =3D SHIPPING, updates <code>inventory_item.{status}</code> =3D SOLD for=
 all packed units.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"431db64140d2">
<p local-id=3D"b4e0ed3a7905">System pushes tracking number to eBay Fulfillm=
ent API.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"4838e93e8425"><strong>Exception Flows:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"99daa7e98c7a">
<li local-id=3D"96c0d5b3a731">
<p local-id=3D"52365bdea140">Scanned item barcode does not match any expect=
ed item: System sounds alert. Packer cannot proceed until mismatch is resol=
ved.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3fbbf0a25765">
<p local-id=3D"8a21b3e890d4">Weight exceeds tolerance: System alerts superv=
isor but does NOT block packing if supervisor approves.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"35281586c4c4">
<p local-id=3D"993b44b2dcda">Carrier API timeout: System queues label reque=
st for retry. Displays error to packer. CCTV timestamps are still saved.</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"c81beec3716f">
<p local-id=3D"603f240baade">Label printer offline: System displays label a=
s PDF for manual print.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"c35dbe1f3c2c" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.6SF-06:OrderManagement">3.6 SF-06: Order Management</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"0f=
b3d027b08a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"51e9e67c681f">
<th data-local-id=3D"436665435a1c" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b991c8cf2923">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"347d1733760b" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"32f8f2ab11b9">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4783d9fa25ff">
<td data-local-id=3D"21f363331d02" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1c789fba7d7e"><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"24d49f8ce93a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3e161f2b916a">[P1] Critical</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"22746b3f44c7">
<td data-local-id=3D"10cc9ba6aa0e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f49e92a36dbd"><strong>Source Models</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"62f527766ba0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d916d2234437"><code>orders</code>, <code>order_item</code>, =
<code>integration_state</code> (orders/models.py)</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"7c693cb21d8d"><strong>Overview</strong>: The Order Managemen=
t module ingests orders from all sales channels (Amazon, eBay =C3=973, Ecwi=
d, Shopify, Walmart, Zoho, Manual) and manages the complete order lifecycle=
 from placement to shipment.</p>
<h4 local-id=3D"9bd4c122f109" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.6.1OrderFieldsReference">3.6.1 Order Fields Reference</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"a8=
caf5e5912a" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e32d528e0e9d">
<th data-local-id=3D"f026985e148e" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b8e9fade9a6c">Column</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"b08b4d15231d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"70a4d5e32e16">Type</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"66ee03dc7eb8" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"141ab18d3fcb">Description</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d7c549e622af">
<td data-local-id=3D"772c974ca9f0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6273a423aa69"><code>id</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e7c9952a50c3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e4b09dcde36e">BIGINT PK</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ead7bcfc0e4f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"181772f4c255">Internal ERP order ID.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"173dea77a9ba">
<td data-local-id=3D"c36d2077ed3a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"257149ddc4df"><code>platform</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b61fe3ec41d7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"46291ec92ec6">ENUM</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3b39df034521" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ba4f37727c65">Source platform: AMAZON, EBAY_MEKONG, EBAY_USA=
V, EBAY_DRAGON, ECWID, SHOPIFY, WALMART, ZOHO, MANUAL.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6fb17ad9dffe">
<td data-local-id=3D"70016aab2437" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ba68f10f528"><code>source</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"babc6afcd819" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b53da4bd16f5">VARCHAR(50)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"64f90cc1826e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5a2c26cd746a">Ingestion source identifier (e.g., ECWID_API, =
WALMART_API, CSV_GENERIC).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cbce859d7c8f">
<td data-local-id=3D"6762be702805" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c94181796fa5"><code>fulfillment_channel</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3da64c94a0e1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2f7ddec47f96">ENUM</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a7ce3f6b9169" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c1eeaed3bae5">SELF_FULFILLED or AMAZON_FBA. FBA orders do no=
t go through warehouse packing.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"238faa772e69">
<td data-local-id=3D"52cca995c17a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6961bb73240e"><code>external_order_id</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"420708724dae" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ecbd57ca029e">VARCHAR(100)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"61eef62c828d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f9d65cbc1e6d">Platform-native order ID. UNIQUE per platform =
(prevents duplicate ingestion).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"42034937ef93">
<td data-local-id=3D"ce6a9f28f6cf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a9d8c1011828"><code>external_order_number</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"057fc6782db6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"21b9a4e9f2b9">VARCHAR(100)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8dfba44e7603" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0aa71fb98354">Human-readable order number (if different from=
 ID).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6f5f71be16d7">
<td data-local-id=3D"abbd16418919" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0ba1e9fa726b"><code>status</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0f4535e64986" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dc9cf8dc3b7b">ENUM</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0214217dfe93" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dbaab2024d0a">Order lifecycle: PENDING =E2=86=92 PROCESSING =
=E2=86=92 READY_TO_SHIP =E2=86=92 SHIPPED =E2=86=92 DELIVERED. Also: CANCEL=
LED, REFUNDED, PARTIALLY_REFUNDED, RETURN, ON_HOLD, ERROR.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"93279d58020b">
<td data-local-id=3D"d6e7400dcd97" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"82b23ea38e49"><code>shipping_status</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"aa5cbf567c09" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4d04e2287e88">ENUM</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"acbae6741d79" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d08a3e8fbbff">Packing sub-status: PENDING =E2=86=92 ON_HOLD =
=E2=86=92 PACKED =E2=86=92 SHIPPING =E2=86=92 DELIVERED =E2=86=92 RETURNED =
=E2=86=92 REFUNDED.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"92d6366c8e30">
<td data-local-id=3D"680eb0013c9c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c4fc574a4ad4"><code>customer_id</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f1d4a89ae117" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f31fca2c1f20">BIGINT FK</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2632d36d0190" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"618fa3d55829">Link to normalized <code>customer</code> recor=
d.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bd3bccbe2ab1">
<td data-local-id=3D"7be62d0db954" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a38eb35806ca"><code>subtotal_amount</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e076d7499474" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"22937aba10fb">NUMERIC(12,2)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a71e275ae6fd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"65c80d0041b9">Order subtotal before tax and shipping.</p></t=
d>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fcb204381ef4">
<td data-local-id=3D"862330739ee5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1a2dd2b5e4a1"><code>tax_amount</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fd6fdb2318c2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c63e5a15cf8">NUMERIC(12,2)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c45dc7d69679" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fa3b4c13ca37">Total tax.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7d6609640eca">
<td data-local-id=3D"39229e3ad4a5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"197a04ad27cb"><code>shipping_amount</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a335d2dec296" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"26ed9a598eee">NUMERIC(12,2)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d5b8a3d556a6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"59f21efc437c">Shipping cost.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"895ae3308485">
<td data-local-id=3D"616dc0a705aa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c26871aea64a"><code>total_amount</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ba6e77336c6c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2ead1e6476b9">NUMERIC(12,2)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"34ba4dc3eb63" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f038271c4b5b">Full order total. Must be =E2=89=A5 0.</p></td=
>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a9dfc281d86d">
<td data-local-id=3D"93e76206a55b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"991f1d9a13d0"><code>currency</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"92b026f9b4d8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"20f65b451cb0">VARCHAR(3)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5526bd551d99" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"317984bc6289">ISO 4217 currency code. Default: USD.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c3c7b79b9cd1">
<td data-local-id=3D"b687a170abca" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3e25b14b69e7"><code>ordered_at</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d7c8229b96d5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1b7df87cc00e">TIMESTAMPTZ</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5e7bdd9fbabd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e4407f3b0990">When order was placed on the platform.</p></td=
>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"112d25653a11">
<td data-local-id=3D"dcbc9f521b72" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b5a9ee016124"><code>shipped_at</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"17a1cb9bd95e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8a046ef41b8">TIMESTAMPTZ</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"68996caef60b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2f4ddb0c2065">When order was physically shipped.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"75c3bd0ae143">
<td data-local-id=3D"38ec41cb4107" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"90243ac1f04d"><code>tracking_number</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"98a2a68552d9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"649bccbcaeff">VARCHAR(100)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"987af74c8cb0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"168b9f109a78">Carrier tracking number.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6eb35ee4df1e">
<td data-local-id=3D"6943181fd124" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"17b1d54eba44"><code>carrier</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0e70d1da62b9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cf16f9cff12b">VARCHAR(50)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"825eccb69488" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d9bf031ec799">Carrier name: UPS, FedEx, USPS.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"65220a7efabf">
<td data-local-id=3D"c5226fc2bdfc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ceb788a828e"><code>verify_status</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c5d6f4664e5a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"85302258e455">VARCHAR(50)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"38aefe900b81" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"422881280c9d">Verification: UNVERIFIED, VERIFIED, READY, ERR=
OR_MISSING_TRACKING, ERROR_COUNT_MISMATCH.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c1c70bb8deda">
<td data-local-id=3D"55601129e47e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f55ff03bf3f0"><code>packing_metadata</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ff67cfc4eb7a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f0cc1a3316b3">JSONB</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"60f5c48b1bd5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"464c450f356b">Contains Synology NAS photo links from packing=
 session.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"77ec5e9a6af3">
<td data-local-id=3D"4067cda11863" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"df3a96f52af8"><code>platform_data</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fb26f6253df3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d91d746cd0b3">JSONB</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2574d7e5aef8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d056bbd971e6">Raw platform-specific order data for auditabil=
ity.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"487b614673ff">
<td data-local-id=3D"8ab936f98de5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3beacb35290d"><code>zoho_id</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"84b4703951cb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"77d727fc8534">VARCHAR(50)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6829cf0ab833" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0522fe10f5fb">Zoho SalesOrder ID after sync.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"08d883f2c2f1">
<td data-local-id=3D"0f82d8301825" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4a1ad0cdec45"><code>zoho_sync_status</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"17f8fb3f21b6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4dcedd107641">ENUM</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"42a56b3f125c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b1c5bb0bc69e">PENDING, SYNCED, ERROR, DIRTY.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ad77ea29ff0d">
<td data-local-id=3D"8f0842aa098b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ef7ab1b552e4"><code>zoho_last_sync_hash</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0f751bbc2924" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d4560db37c0">VARCHAR(64)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"aee56602e295" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3efa17939e89">SHA-256 hash of last synced payload (echo-loop=
 prevention).</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
