</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"3d35246c5f1c" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.6.3FunctionalRequirements">3.6.3 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"83=
3e1da51a6d" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f784ad722aab">
<th data-local-id=3D"606d0ee17f63" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5c4a2f89ed53">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"17244e28b45d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"e54764fdd4d0">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"6de6651a6b75" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4fe81900722b">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"34d66799c81a">
<td data-local-id=3D"282e3061e742" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"128b9a1e47c0">REQ-ORD-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d8fd52263f00" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1afc1e816295">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"90fdee08d1bc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2bf068848097">System SHALL poll each connected platform for =
new orders at a configurable interval (default: every 15 minutes). The anch=
or timestamp is stored in <code>integration_state.{last_successful_sync}</c=
ode>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2f48fc2cd751">
<td data-local-id=3D"1b59f9e0d7cb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1828ea4451b5">REQ-ORD-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1c4f937f4bcd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fc5b7c2735ff">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8cf79fd6d87c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f4d037038979">Order import SHALL be idempotent: importing th=
e same <code>external_order_id</code> for the same <code>platform</code> a =
second time must not create a duplicate row (enforced by <code>uq_order_pla=
tform_external_id</code>).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bec1f87f65fc">
<td data-local-id=3D"783d38b9ace4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"63a0e9ae039f">REQ-ORD-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ee3c29e7acb4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7aaae755acf1">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"be8eaafb248a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c09970246f02">System SHALL attempt automatic SKU matching fo=
r each <code>order_item</code> by looking up <code>platform_listing</code> =
via <code>{external_sku}</code> or <code>{external_asin}</code>. If a match=
 is found, system sets <code>{variant_id}</code> and <code>{status}</code> =
=3D MATCHED.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b31891031224">
<td data-local-id=3D"4e594c24eff3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"df2b27298d05">REQ-ORD-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2f7167b04651" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f9f1d8dff24b">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4d7bf4b121f7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"605af17ee578">Unmatched order items (<code>{status}</code> =
=3D UNMATCHED) SHALL be surfaced in the Order Management dashboard for manu=
al matching by staff.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6d8cbf33e130">
<td data-local-id=3D"bb365776e8a9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2ffb21260981">REQ-ORD-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dd9fdd682a8d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"76119d4d6105">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d0de5909f8da" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"57a3186df4ef">System SHALL set <code>integration_state.{curr=
ent_status}</code> =3D SYNCING during an active sync and =3D IDLE upon comp=
letion. Status =3D ERROR on failure.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"02f7c023e170">
<td data-local-id=3D"c5ab96720b24" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f680cb61cc1b">REQ-ORD-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6ef2f5c5e5c3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b7e3651ef2f6">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d13704761447" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"79b9d6b7df9d">System SHALL support Amazon FBA orders (<code>=
{fulfillment_channel}</code> =3D AMAZON_FBA). FBA orders do not go through =
the warehouse packing workflow.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"43917e373071">
<td data-local-id=3D"af8b83506514" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0ad7dc4cc724">REQ-ORD-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6c298d1106f7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9df04d865289">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b4cb297c650c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c66abcf18e45">System SHALL allow manual order creation with =
<code>{platform}</code> =3D MANUAL and <code>{source}</code> =3D MANUAL.</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0f1486de4ef5">
<td data-local-id=3D"59df063aaa0a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e686a235466f">REQ-ORD-008</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"034d6e1cf5d0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dcabab88719b">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"85fe581a89c2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da44382e159f">System SHALL preserve the raw platform API res=
ponse in <code>{platform_data}</code> JSONB for auditability.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2ea7d087c991">
<td data-local-id=3D"ff56ab599a81" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8d430034dc1d">REQ-ORD-009</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8d876b7e02a6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"44c7f7896d08">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1482aca434a6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c6724470dc77">System SHALL propagate order <code>{shipping_s=
tatus}</code> updates back to the origin platform (e.g., confirm shipment w=
ith tracking on eBay/Amazon).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"26a14edc4a2d">
<td data-local-id=3D"6bccdfea44ea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d38a675e85e0">REQ-ORD-010</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1a8811dc0520" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e08f51a16734">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a71a20c8373c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a9e979db7fb7">System SHALL support verify status transitions=
 to catch common errors: ERROR_MISSING_TRACKING (shipped but no tracking) a=
nd ERROR_COUNT_MISMATCH (item count does not match).</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"b023a092ba43" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.7SF-07:CustomerManagement">3.7 SF-07: Customer Management</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"09=
f4157da608" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5f133ccc7876">
<th data-local-id=3D"d35097831e09" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"99a6771ea7cc">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"3633b5ade490" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"afac44cb799c">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c80a5442cee0">
<td data-local-id=3D"aaeab99c9f8b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8e06b502eac7"><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3917d982668b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a0df8af213c6">[P2] High</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"18dc7ff53788">
<td data-local-id=3D"afc61b5a9c1a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3fa5ec09f10c"><strong>Source Models</strong></p></td>
