<h4 local-id=3D"a98bba569b77" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.7.2FunctionalRequirements">3.7.2 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"fd=
7185dd1772" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"055a03823e9b">
<th data-local-id=3D"f06b6d265b50" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ec2fc32bf09e">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"ce296c206851" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"29c36e437189">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"4515c8ab4f82" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"44fdfbe5e675">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a48e644f3481">
<td data-local-id=3D"797d5942883e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c26290cec5f7">REQ-CUS-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9eea88a90f5d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2099d8be6b56">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"45cdffe2dc0b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d6903b92f69a">System SHALL create or update a <code>customer=
</code> record when an order is imported. The primary match key is <code>{e=
mail}</code> for non-Amazon orders and <code>{amazon_buyer_id}</code> for A=
mazon orders.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bd973817ee29">
<td data-local-id=3D"fc3f2aa1f776" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"58e70e65ce7c">REQ-CUS-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6488458f680e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9250d55b0c04">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3b38ecfd0e3c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1cc7d02400ab">System SHALL expose customer shipping address =
via Order computed properties that read from the linked <code>customer</cod=
e> record.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7d15a086e567">
<td data-local-id=3D"8c8907028032" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0576c6f5b264">REQ-CUS-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"16baef377b53" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d37e4d06f98b">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a402db0835cc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"189043e2fad6">Customer records SHALL be synced bidirectional=
ly to Zoho Inventory Contacts using the <code>ZohoSyncMixin</code> fields.<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e4c8a48a9e12">
<td data-local-id=3D"ecdb5985de1b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fb3cb430506f">REQ-CUS-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"912ba933d8d6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"32323ab714a5">[P3]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"15a10f3541fc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"49805874f9be">System SHALL support soft-deletion via <code>{=
is_active}</code> =3D false. Deactivated customers propagate to Zoho as "in=
active".</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
