<p local-id=3D"9607e35046be">TEXT</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"44a3a358120c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"77d99986dc31">Full product description on this platform.</p>=
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9cea8a5df6ba">
<td data-local-id=3D"1c5e65a94942" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"798c5962952d"><code>listing_price</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7825cbdc7f7e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"647075adfcd8">NUMERIC(10,2)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b966186bafad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"43a66b25a20e">Current asking price on this platform.</p></td=
>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"594e77cda5d4">
<td data-local-id=3D"94ebb15fc9b3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e1f6912d106e"><code>listing_quantity</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cee2816338cd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a2a101191328">INTEGER</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e21242917d7e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0a9d9c04b575">Current stock quantity shown on this platform.=
</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"32821e26ec15">
<td data-local-id=3D"6876d7eeb3b5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f0580a36c2f4"><code>listing_type</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c0c0b435c773" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c244e1bc80b">VARCHAR(100)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"da3a4940803f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5a55f124bc73">Platform-specific listing type (e.g., FixedPri=
ce, Auction).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"418eadfd9d78">
<td data-local-id=3D"b996f14f382a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e714d1bb255b"><code>listing_condition</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e21080f10a3f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a799a1dd302e">VARCHAR(100)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ff61b2342bd2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6ba0273d0532">Platform-specific condition label (raw string =
as returned by API).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ba80594aff3a">
<td data-local-id=3D"a6de84abdeed" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1c316356f7fa"><code>upc</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fba9fd187526" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"499e600bfb80">VARCHAR(64)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"10fa56ff3f5e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"86784fc2bc58">UPC/GTIN used by the listing.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5267349205f2">
<td data-local-id=3D"9147457036ba" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1c6504a3439c"><code>sync_status</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"39d8c879dbfd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c962f493529c">ENUM</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"95f02ed028cd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c788121f411">PENDING (needs push), SYNCED (clean), ERROR (r=
etrying).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6b9c8365afb6">
<td data-local-id=3D"a1db15270546" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8b94f1b544e9"><code>last_synced_at</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8e4ad0112306" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c2775c800209">TIMESTAMPTZ</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8e0f6488a419" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"92f659df9c9b">Last successful sync.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1c4d102f792c">
<td data-local-id=3D"1c0940e17e35" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5c412e157d03"><code>sync_error_message</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"eceb727db1c4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ce3027ac520">TEXT</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b15f8cf5ccb4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0d3b2009bbf3">Error from last failed sync.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c95bc8a26400">
<td data-local-id=3D"a343510c957f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8db6e962db5e"><code>platform_metadata</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3e84c464bcf8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dc9af772fe8e">JSONB</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f98f532d43f6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"961c82ae6a47">Platform-specific extras (Amazon bullet points=
, eBay category ID).</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"470c46f417aa" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.8.2FunctionalRequirements">3.8.2 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"c7=
666e41db86" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"70c7efc7d06e">
<th data-local-id=3D"25120fd2bee7" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8bd5d3ca5ef1">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"3f8e0be5b6d2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5e04285aafb3">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"f53de7e75cff" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"96fab1ef4e54">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c9904f704a64">
<td data-local-id=3D"fd04074a591b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e3a04b6070ab">REQ-LIST-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a8dbbc828651" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e527050bfe48">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"89c716b2b063" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ec619f14140b">System SHALL store one <code>platform_listing<=
/code> row per variant-per-platform-per-account. Multiple eBay accounts =3D=
 multiple listing rows for the same variant.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d1f25e9655a3">
<td data-local-id=3D"d445785f91ca" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8d5a9184e96f">REQ-LIST-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5a0cd83cba7b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8c99c09d2c9d">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"faf443a0bd65" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"815fe0dc47ba">System SHALL store OAuth credentials per marke=
tplace account encrypted at rest. Fields: <code>{access_token}</code>, <cod=
e>{refresh_token}</code>, <code>{token_expires_at}</code>, <code>{refresh_t=
oken_expires_at}</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1cb85502b828">
<td data-local-id=3D"e25f1f5d7039" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7a6f4d7c566e">REQ-LIST-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9413ad0cf317" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6297234a90b4">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"35c8b59b04f0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d1aacbfd9f6">System SHALL automatically refresh access toke=
ns before they expire using the stored <code>{refresh_token}</code>. Failed=
 refreshes must alert the System Administrator.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c4c64e6064cc">
<td data-local-id=3D"e8f7114596fd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6506a7eaf9c3">REQ-LIST-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"13d8bf85de1c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"be0b1303d148">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dd2a9ad08ebb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"47f7e2f6ca1f">System SHALL poll each connected listing for h=
ealth status every 2 hours and record the result in the listing health log.=
</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"16097bb8db42">
<td data-local-id=3D"1a069f8df942" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"47e76c58205d">REQ-LIST-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"51f1c341a7c1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7d1949ae2920">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"266bc192af58" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3b278a6e53b0">System SHALL set <code>{sync_status}</code> =
=3D ERROR and populate <code>{sync_error_message}</code> when a platform AP=
I call fails. A background retry job shall attempt re-sync with exponential=
 backoff.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c3d0ec08594b">
<td data-local-id=3D"98ff0dd0c3bb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a98616966bb6">REQ-LIST-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7ac6602cb54b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3b13fcf9d521">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ec16df92a5ea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"28185d008b18">When an <code>inventory_item</code> status cha=
nges to SOLD, system SHALL update <code>{listing_quantity}</code> and push =
the new count to all active channel listings for that variant within =E2=89=
=A4 5 minutes.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c47c3b958990">
<td data-local-id=3D"528f3fb8d7e8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"60dfbeb7b960">REQ-LIST-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5aa07297778c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b7ff4d22a36f">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"629c4e5cc870" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"00da05858a8d">System SHALL maintain a Listing Health Dashboa=
rd showing: listing name, platform, account, current status (ACTIVE / SUPPR=
ESSED / INACTIVE / VIOLATING), last checked timestamp.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"498a9011fa59">
<td data-local-id=3D"4ed0a015b7ad" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4da537653904">REQ-LIST-008</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e78af269238d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a18ab9eb5797">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"17e736e330f9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d7c814ad8ae4">System SHALL generate in-app and email alerts =
when a listing transitions to SUPPRESSED or VIOLATING status.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0ee93955e096">
<td data-local-id=3D"d0b9f4345dea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37a4a2ba9600">REQ-LIST-009</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"13befd5a0804" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"510855d83a81">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"69d2079ba9a4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3d7c763bf34b">System SHALL support bulk listing creation fro=
m the product variant catalog: select multiple variants =E2=86=92 push to s=
elected platforms with pre-defined templates.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"103a80132386">
<td data-local-id=3D"e3cbe3042598" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"885b4157013f">REQ-LIST-010</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f3275eefc14b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a1a6bde686e5">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"270361ddacfa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d720ba8f9167">System SHALL track per-channel sales KPIs: Gro=
ss Sales, Units Sold, Return Rate, Average Selling Price, Defect Rate (wher=
e available from platform API).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c08ef89c3466">
<td data-local-id=3D"857c7a7743a3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"47018ce24585">REQ-LIST-011</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b0b1a552ffaa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8400019c2a37">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2cc1a5b0fcdb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3780f7c25674">For Amazon FBA listings, system SHALL read FBA=
 stock levels from Amazon SP-API Inventory API. These do not deduct from ER=
P inventory stock (FBA stock lives in Amazon warehouses).</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"4e2cc744c4d2" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.8.3UseCases">3.8.3 Use Cases</h4>
<h5 local-id=3D"ec22806e3c8a" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-UseCaseUC-LIST-01:ResolveaSuppressedeBayListing">Use Case UC-LIST-01: Res=
olve a Suppressed eBay Listing</h5>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"bb=
237a829445" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3cabe081eb4b">
<th data-local-id=3D"7e6981195d5d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"1c402712dc40">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"8133a363196e" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"31799be7bcd2">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"69c1ac1f4f71">
<td data-local-id=3D"5ae76673046f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ab04ca9a7191"><strong>Use Case ID</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d41756d31f7a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fa6f7ef7c617">UC-LIST-01</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9f25126310a0">
<td data-local-id=3D"ad157b266bec" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e30bb058acf0"><strong>Actor(s)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"cc26eddb9e12" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a72a67fb3af3">Listing Manager</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"54512ec98bd5">
<td data-local-id=3D"240c8fd68950" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b257ffa9d6a2"><strong>Preconditions</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1d3f6a9e7e86" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f321b103e515">eBay account EBAY_USAV is connected and token =
is valid.; Background health poller is scheduled and running.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"112d059edf4b">
<td data-local-id=3D"ede4da25ad84" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"12a8a370320a"><strong>Postconditions</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"fea5eafd03ec" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c656a1093479">Listing restored to Active. Alert archived. He=
alth log updated with resolution timestamp.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"e588edc8cd8c"><strong>Basic Flow:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"db6c5c5f4772">
<li local-id=3D"3c1b4db564da">
<p local-id=3D"061333ea6468">Background cron polls eBay Inventory API every=
 2 hours.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bea4d9500c16">
<p local-id=3D"0fc98d0fc1b1">API returns listing X as "Out of Stock" but ER=
P shows 3 units AVAILABLE.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1d61385ea2ed">
<p local-id=3D"a46779ec0a91">System records health status change. Sets list=
ing alert (SUPPRESSED).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ca8bcdda637d">
<p local-id=3D"162c64ef094a">Listing Manager receives in-app notification: =
"Listing XXXXX on EBAY_USAV is Suppressed."</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ec528ab1fe84">
<p local-id=3D"04e28acb2d53">Manager opens Listing Health Dashboard, locate=
s the listing.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ec02a2d5f2f7">
<p local-id=3D"f8e8e670b26a">Manager clicks "Force Sync Quantity". System c=
alls eBay Inventory API to push quantity=3D3.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e594ebfabeeb">
<p local-id=3D"b550a1de3a32">eBay API responds 200 OK. System updates <code=
>{listing_quantity}</code> =3D 3 and <code>{sync_status}</code> =3D SYNCED.=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cf26723ca8bb">
<p local-id=3D"b4a4a0bf5f26">Alert is resolved and archived in listing heal=
th log.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"8c84e4cfbf4c"><strong>Exception Flows:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"be835feaed30">
<li local-id=3D"6f767cfe3fd8">
<p local-id=3D"35549c83c925">eBay API rate limit exceeded: System queues sy=
nc request and retries after the rate limit window.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e368048ec1ce">
<p local-id=3D"6eabbd007b6f">OAuth refresh token expired: System triggers r=
e-auth flow. Admin receives email to reconnect account.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"9a0e185f76ae" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.9SF-09:Purchasing&amp;Bidding">3.9 SF-09: Purchasing &amp; Bidding</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"72=
bcd677d476" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"276a4c1d0540">
<th data-local-id=3D"0256fa52f0ec" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"81ebd63d6101">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"314bfbc2b716" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"36b9195360cf">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ebef14ae4133">
<td data-local-id=3D"938ca081e40b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ac56840d1a23"><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f605cb5439cd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2d59821c0a11">[P2] High</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"92198f2da0a7">
<td data-local-id=3D"460bc9912103" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ce36b9c2c49d"><strong>Source Models</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8e4589de8a2a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b108405fed3"><code>purchase_orders</code> (schema.ts), <cod=
e>bids</code> (schema.ts)</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"43138fb0b50b" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.9.1FunctionalRequirements">3.9.1 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"dd=
341eac3006" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4808a90aa865">
<th data-local-id=3D"1fb565b5cd6d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"44025a409e27">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"916c774d580a" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"bc5ee9d1aacb">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"156ec4b0e868" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8c539c184c96">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c2dd0e62b80d">
<td data-local-id=3D"26a867a72dce" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7b46e2512cd3">REQ-PUR-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"22eed22d1b14" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fa8e0567a824">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e3db10b60350" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5f98bf8c8dab">System SHALL allow buyers to create bid record=
s with: lot description, source (BULQ, B-Stock, Direct Supplier), max bid a=
mount, estimated unit count.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"01b27db3fa73">
<td data-local-id=3D"13ffd82c3d51" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ca4e8b7b9cac">REQ-PUR-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"88b29b17e711" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dbc541c878da">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9a49e90a82da" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0c2c7869a5cc">System SHALL calculate a suggested max bid usi=
ng: (Average Selling Price of comparable SKU) =C3=97 estimated unit count =
=C3=97 target margin %.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"816cca10b981">
<td data-local-id=3D"ce154afcb70a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ebc10e69e90f">REQ-PUR-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f00ba326e7ac" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7a41d29a5504">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"aca3b148aabe" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d99c0e584671">System SHALL support bid status lifecycle: DRA=
FT =E2=86=92 SUBMITTED =E2=86=92 WON =E2=86=92 LOST =E2=86=92 CANCELLED.</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a99ad03fa6d1">
<td data-local-id=3D"ba761b02e016" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"58ca82d1b497">REQ-PUR-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"88d6e6916aa7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dd02cd9b8146">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f5a296afc637" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b0a351c8dbe6">System SHALL auto-create a Purchase Order when=
 a bid is marked WON. PO inherits lot details and max bid amount as <code>{=
total_cost}</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"93531446b0bd">
<td data-local-id=3D"e2013b4e85ee" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4b79781885e5">REQ-PUR-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1b8c0f23ceb6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e2188b100620">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5cf049c02b8a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"034a496a340b">System SHALL track PO lifecycle: DRAFT =E2=86=
=92 CONFIRMED =E2=86=92 PARTIAL =E2=86=92 RECEIVED =E2=86=92 CLOSED.</p></t=
d>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0d829d6ffe31">
<td data-local-id=3D"4cbdf1dd6989" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cbb038e03f8f">REQ-PUR-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e1ee725dfc06" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"72b3bb920a68">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"83387bcd5685" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cc0684423393">System SHALL calculate <code>{cost_basis_per_u=
nit}</code> =3D <code>{total_cost}</code> / <code>{unit_count}</code> and s=
tore on the PO. This value is stamped on each <code>inventory_item.{cost_ba=
sis}</code> upon receiving.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1ef6546545da">
<td data-local-id=3D"ad1eabd5971b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d0a191442734">REQ-PUR-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ae65290d75d8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"645c344aca20">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2009a2e4a19d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3e6075469a0a">System SHALL link receiving sessions to their =
originating PO, enabling full traceability from bid =E2=86=92 PO =E2=86=92 =
receiving session =E2=86=92 inventory item =E2=86=92 sold order.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
