<h4 local-id=3D"4399d1cdc180" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.10.1FunctionalRequirements">3.10.1 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"a6=
60c54b48e6" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b798de24d89c">
<th data-local-id=3D"526a3346b21f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9d38dc81037b">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a669adce2c0a" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"65cfea3f72c4">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"fadce0299f94" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"c2713bc24239">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d7fb780deac3">
<td data-local-id=3D"dc6cc99d8ad0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7d267e6176b2">REQ-SUP-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ef1ada99161b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bf8af6efd834">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a477b5366f91" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fd21a1b440f4">System SHALL aggregate customer messages from =
Amazon, eBay (all accounts), Shopify, Ecwid, and Walmart into a single Unif=
ied Inbox.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0fa2fa2b4fb9">
<td data-local-id=3D"c3dc2c28d031" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"452852be8643">REQ-SUP-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"34384b76e346" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ca97a13d2e4">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"93049b9075f5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"31e85c7c6f64">Each inbox message SHALL be linked to its orig=
inating order and customer record.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6b7f2d584fed">
<td data-local-id=3D"9839d37a5b24" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2e5b859444fd">REQ-SUP-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d4facb16fbf0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"db2a1e674bc4">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ecf8b99b28d5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6f87d9a23dc2">System SHALL provide RMA creation workflow: is=
sue type =E2=86=92 return label generation =E2=86=92 refund/replacement tra=
cking.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b5dad0988124">
<td data-local-id=3D"5cd1be82759d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1df87a2c096c">REQ-SUP-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"50977774920c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6f556368b7af">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ccc0d5fb833b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"28afa7b92918">System SHALL provide a warranty check tool: in=
put serial number =E2=86=92 returns warranty status from <code>inventory_it=
em</code> records.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"deec34d8219b">
<td data-local-id=3D"32ea6d5615b4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4d296d27f271">REQ-SUP-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"138a7a81eb61" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7c1667ccec18">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ebeb6555e783" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"88b9a173cc2f">System SHALL allow support agents to view the =
linked packing CCTV footage timestamps from the order detail screen. A deep=
-link URL opens the NVR system at the recorded timestamp.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"32881708f5ae">
<td data-local-id=3D"29e0d87f4e94" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7488c10940a4">REQ-SUP-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"506f7bb51255" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e22d2df96932">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5bf5a9e1d44e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ac141a7f9fe">CCTV footage access SHALL be restricted to Cus=
tomer Support Agent and Security Manager roles only. All access attempts ar=
e logged.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bb295512fe3c">
<td data-local-id=3D"e5970a5c8fbc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7d39f339d642">REQ-SUP-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"307adbb4c9f5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f56314e5275f">[P3]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3505cea02c97" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2093f1547c34">System SHALL track ticket resolution time from=
 creation to close. SLA breach alerts at &gt; 48 hours unresolved.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"138e2ca8d785" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.10.2UseCases">3.10.2 Use Cases</h4>
<h5 local-id=3D"f04473b968b9" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-UseCaseUC-SUP-01:Handle&quot;MissingItem&quot;ClaimwithCCTVEvidence">Use =
Case UC-SUP-01: Handle "Missing Item" Claim with CCTV Evidence</h5>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"f3=
5e662e6c8d" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9d99b929caaa">
<th data-local-id=3D"7fd7e7692c01" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"bd061ce69e02">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"8d2b47fc68ea" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7468a5dff817">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4575434ba2f4">
<td data-local-id=3D"65d89407e665" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"29589f728bc2"><strong>Use Case ID</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"30204cbde109" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4fba74f819f3">UC-SUP-01</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ca30b2e70520">
<td data-local-id=3D"5f1d36d81c89" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c9e85c93865a"><strong>Actor(s)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a411e0c379f8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"75fb4a4c6a19">Customer Support Agent</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a7121b530519">
<td data-local-id=3D"20b25d5cc173" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"540914045e3c"><strong>Preconditions</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"efa754b41f31" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"df53bd4911c0">Order has been shipped. Packing session log ex=
ists with CCTV timestamps.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ddd3b6a4d0a8">
<td data-local-id=3D"d037f241eabb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"632d758f657e"><strong>Postconditions</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2d8e4f8a0453" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c2bff85f0661">Ticket resolved. CCTV access logged in audit t=
rail. Resolution status recorded on ticket.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"13c3966539ef"><strong>Basic Flow:</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"98c3244f31fc">
<li local-id=3D"504cc6e2cfbd">
<p local-id=3D"1f951f27455a">Customer sends message via eBay claiming item =
was missing from package.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6e9ec9792f96">
<p local-id=3D"96344e2b7c1b">Agent opens the ticket in Unified Inbox. Ticke=
t is auto-linked to the order.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8e92080e1f5b">
<p local-id=3D"e30dff76098f">Agent navigates to Order Detail =E2=86=92 Pack=
ing Log tab.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"062f5bf3267d">
<p local-id=3D"e10ddc1f05f5">System displays packing session: packer name, =
timestamp, CCTV camera ID, start/end timestamps.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bc561f507d6d">
<p local-id=3D"c453fad5a6c2">Agent clicks "View Footage". System generates =
a deep-link to NVR at <code>{cctv_start_ts}</code>.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c404b44725b1">
<p local-id=3D"3cd9fc145aa5">Agent reviews footage. Item is visible being p=
acked on video.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e4a0f6f1d1f2">
<p local-id=3D"bcdfd1be5947">Agent responds to customer with evidence, clos=
es claim as Invalid.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8f612cfa21c1">
<p local-id=3D"a63cca290f99">If footage shows item was missed: Agent initia=
tes RMA and replacement shipment.</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"fc267de33b51"><strong>Exception Flows:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"8165c199dd69">
<li local-id=3D"d4c4ced8e2ee">
<p local-id=3D"5b6c02172662">CCTV footage is older than 90 days (retention =
limit): System displays "Footage Expired. Evidence unavailable."</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e9d2dc86ab09">
<p local-id=3D"bf9de5407861">NVR system is offline: System displays "CCTV s=
ystem unreachable" and logs the failed access attempt.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"9097c37cba10" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.11SF-11:SecurityOperations&amp;CCTV">3.11 SF-11: Security Operations &a=
mp; CCTV</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"e7=
b59d5c9310" class=3D"confluenceTable">
