<th data-local-id=3D"b4a23f9cb22e" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"40b69c9bbf8a">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cc397a587d41">
<td data-local-id=3D"d933ece61a77" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3c87fe7e5f71"><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b61b3f0bd8c1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"90848463bd89">[P2] High</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e20ca7f88fe3">
<td data-local-id=3D"018d2c085411" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1e913893c46e"><strong>Source Models</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"96ac5c376739" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2b56ff8917dd"><code>packer_logs.camera_id</code>, <code>pack=
er_logs.cctv_start_ts</code>, <code>packer_logs.cctv_end_ts</code>; <code>s=
tation_definitions</code> (schema.ts)</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"be64c15ae80e" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.11.1FunctionalRequirements">3.11.1 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"56=
f238c32abe" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6209955c0bec">
<th data-local-id=3D"248a43a63efa" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"916aec78e183">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"12b8ff637b66" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"25874d70f5a5">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"b0243058e8a6" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8666e9c4670e">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c00eadf2563d">
<td data-local-id=3D"52dfcd6a7318" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5e9c16284b6d">REQ-SEC-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d4bc36590596" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aa84208400d3">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c1d96a65affa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"33929921203e">System SHALL maintain a <code>station_definiti=
ons</code> table mapping each physical packing station to one or more CCTV =
camera IDs.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"88b1d2abaa9d">
<td data-local-id=3D"7814d33f7855" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5ca4fce88576">REQ-SEC-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5f39588e7cd4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4fea202e654f">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"abbf875607a2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c695a297b500">System SHALL record <code>{cctv_start_ts}</cod=
e> (UTC) when a packing session is initiated at a station.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5d10aa0da137">
<td data-local-id=3D"89b69a994354" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e83ed37a4c05">REQ-SEC-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9d6a91fff655" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c787afa4122e">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"be98cbd82f0c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e111d346740f">System SHALL record <code>{cctv_end_ts}</code>=
 (UTC) when a packing session is completed or cancelled.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"49652a231f6f">
<td data-local-id=3D"13ca9ede8b8d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7f463cdd3bfe">REQ-SEC-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2a92e680fb8e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ff6850c1a0a2">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4eb07473a716" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6d516e060238">System SHALL provide a deep-link URL template =
per NVR system that accepts camera ID and timestamp parameters.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"047c1eb65f78">
<td data-local-id=3D"8f6b4218904f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7dff2b6f9f5c">REQ-SEC-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6d94d50016b1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c00d4e741369">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e66f53548dd8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"411e0743411d">CCTV footage access SHALL require one of the f=
ollowing roles: Customer Support Agent (for claim evidence), Security Manag=
er (for audit).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"990a796e3aac">
<td data-local-id=3D"1604abcce667" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ae1d946fb24">REQ-SEC-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"40b4828e8bca" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"88b8ec55c499">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"30516ee697f5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d9994f94fd51">Every CCTV footage access attempt SHALL be wri=
tten to a security audit log with: staff ID, role, order ID, <code>accessed=
_at</code> timestamp, and outcome (SUCCESS / OFFLINE / EXPIRED).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"95484ebeb2d2">
<td data-local-id=3D"f24f195cff64" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f0ae729c997d">REQ-SEC-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"57090953f7d8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d66b1861c6ce">[P3]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a35e5c0f26d6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2c5a46ac0775">Security Manager SHALL be able to export a sec=
urity report covering all packing sessions, access events, and unverified o=
rders within a date range.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"5f26eece06fe" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.12SF-12:ZohoInventorySynchronization">3.12 SF-12: Zoho Inventory Synchr=
onization</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"c8=
4edf51da24" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d8ac5f1da9f0">
<th data-local-id=3D"217bb74b4d55" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"6891483a743d">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"9af7e6cd2b23" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"e1ed3412ea1e">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"323e34681c0e">
<td data-local-id=3D"24052e21cfea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1372d208b4d9"><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"33f427e1ea40" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"646e8beaabd5">[P1] Critical</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d03c8902412b">
<td data-local-id=3D"370fe20e5ee7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"58df69f2cd52"><strong>Source Models</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1e568f387a07" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9eac622c40b6"><code>ZohoSyncMixin</code> (zoho_id, zoho_last=
_sync_hash, zoho_last_synced_at, zoho_sync_error) applied to: Customer, Ord=
er. <code>ProductVariant</code> (zoho_item_id, zoho_sync_status, zoho_last_=
synced_at, zoho_last_sync_hash, zoho_sync_error).</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"487dd9efa122" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.12.1FunctionalRequirements">3.12.1 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"65=
0befe56f8c" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a7148f7568c5">
<th data-local-id=3D"4f208b6eeddc" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0dcdb7fe65b0">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"ee27ecbf8696" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"ef4f133eb1a1">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"bd6f149aa38d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"43f4dab71204">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a72de0caafbe">
<td data-local-id=3D"b507affd5e6f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"23e5e976fd3a">REQ-ZOH-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"34f76bb30de4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"54d49896cf69">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a288bacd426e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"78f985ed960e">System SHALL sync <code>product_variant</code>=
 records to Zoho Inventory Items. The Zoho Item ID is stored in <code>{zoho=
_item_id}</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3a5cbccd2e16">
<td data-local-id=3D"1fac8d87de9d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"96b96ddb96ae">REQ-ZOH-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"74f1ca8945ed" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7fc7220e807b">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0e3c952b8f37" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"84f23a53826c">System SHALL sync <code>order</code> records t=
o Zoho Sales Orders. The Zoho SO ID is stored in <code>{zoho_id}</code>.</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"46ca04a8d1a1">
<td data-local-id=3D"a57e69ca777b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2b10e8f3c743">REQ-ZOH-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1d80857f0e6a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"86eb48679d4f">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e00036fa1ba2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3fedd57bea4a">System SHALL sync <code>customer</code> record=
s to Zoho Contacts. The Zoho Contact ID is stored in <code>{zoho_id}</code>=
.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1a1dd2bb45b1">
<td data-local-id=3D"46d74e621400" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bc6e252c12f7">REQ-ZOH-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5c1762c23a68" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c4e28ffc314e">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"842d6205f848" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"60e8d1b28035">System SHALL prevent sync echo-loops by comput=
ing a SHA-256 hash of each payload before sync and comparing to <code>{zoho=
_last_sync_hash}</code>. If the hash matches, the sync is skipped.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"777ee374a842">
<td data-local-id=3D"08c834225e8f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b595d720b88d">REQ-ZOH-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"89340ce3b5fe" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"94d518efc793">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"87b97fc885dc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"598fc9fe63e5">When an inbound Zoho webhook updates a record,=
 system SHALL set the <code>_updated_by_sync</code> transient flag to preve=
nt the SQLAlchemy <code>after_update</code> listener from re-enqueuing an o=
utbound sync.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5e242cba9670">
<td data-local-id=3D"2b4378c7b498" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b1bd8af268f8">REQ-ZOH-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6cbb604e3334" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4cfa29c99c70">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8f1c66a70696" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e02722820d01"><code>{zoho_sync_status}</code> values: PENDIN=
G (not yet synced), SYNCED (clean), ERROR (retry), DIRTY (local change, pen=
ding re-sync).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"dbe413bb0dcd">
<td data-local-id=3D"e1cb627be756" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"463c04b45a4e">REQ-ZOH-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b2c9c84a6f76" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"77202de9d328">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"84583e1eb2ba" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"67fda84162a8">Sync errors SHALL be captured in <code>{zoho_s=
ync_error}</code> (TEXT). Admins can view and retry failed syncs from a Syn=
c Status dashboard.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
