</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b193fc6afd03">
<td data-local-id=3D"9f530f983402" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"218188dfbd04"><code>mobile_display_config</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f3902c6efa7a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2a898b36e884">JSONB</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"678dfa028e07" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9d3edd59d38a">Per-staff mobile UI overrides (layers on top o=
f role defaults).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"aff286d3cdc4">
<td data-local-id=3D"63255b0a4015" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"637c54e5266e"><code>organization_id</code></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5fa2bf45e6db" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"684ffaaa6999">UUID</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f9c32adcc041" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6fefead35468">Tenant association. NOT NULL.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"dace1947b0de" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.13.2FunctionalRequirements">3.13.2 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"65=
d6778687cd" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d6c0038781fa">
<th data-local-id=3D"9507039453dd" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8e24a6bbb4ad">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"fc14a994ef9e" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"17540d77109a">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"86fbafbe1680" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"396ee5077647">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f500aa966d7f">
<td data-local-id=3D"46219edd3d31" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6c92a532ce4a">REQ-AUTH-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3a86b1cd4f8b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"590bdfd7bd2a">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f7ce9430592e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7b311eb67af6">System SHALL support two authentication method=
s: (1) SSO (Google/Azure via sso_subject+sso_provider) for admin portal, (2=
) PIN for warehouse station kiosks.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ab70fd7c24a2">
<td data-local-id=3D"c68382f4e91e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"90fb56d884a6">REQ-AUTH-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"90d2b3daa6fb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2f055a050118">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a8168eaec01e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0a4da047e11c">PIN SHALL be stored as a bcrypt hash in <code>=
{pin_hash}</code>. Plaintext PINs must never be persisted.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"df59bc414201">
<td data-local-id=3D"d3083f9f9226" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9b61fc70f8b2">REQ-AUTH-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4c2fa9fc06b4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"96524d8699b5">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"72798060df3c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"afc293978646">System SHALL lock a staff account after 5 cons=
ecutive failed PIN attempts. Account is locked until <code>{pin_locked_unti=
l}</code> timestamp. Lockout is loggable and releasable by admin.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d1eda92b5ba1">
<td data-local-id=3D"17f676c723e8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"52408271c380">REQ-AUTH-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c13aff26fa12" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"af343ed2bc51">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"31588669b8fb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"82213c6c4838">System SHALL implement RBAC using base <code>r=
oles</code> plus per-staff overrides via <code>{permissions_added}</code> a=
nd <code>{permissions_removed}</code> arrays.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ac80be1ce946">
<td data-local-id=3D"c5bf1252a1a7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"105124c34231">REQ-AUTH-005</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d9a257eb2d67" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7512f4959dec">[P1]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2e6522f5fa4a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2192e698b744">All API routes SHALL validate the staff JWT or=
 session token. Unauthorized requests receive HTTP 401. Forbidden (insuffic=
ient role) requests receive HTTP 403.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"49cb7e0edcb0">
<td data-local-id=3D"3bb85a9f3a61" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b528363e44e3">REQ-AUTH-006</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6be0679deae8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f04da9b8186d">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9dee65830df3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bb22165c20dc">System SHALL enforce tenant isolation: all dat=
a access must filter by <code>{organization_id}</code>. This is enforced by=
 PostgreSQL RLS policies.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"be5b56c60217">
<td data-local-id=3D"e8408a0b1aed" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c43bea6eb993">REQ-AUTH-007</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7d48e24ac839" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5c11a118f2f1">[P2]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6e1cbff19417" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"06518afcaaf0">System SHALL maintain a mobile display configu=
ration per staff member (<code>{mobile_display_config}</code> JSONB) that o=
verrides role-level mobile defaults.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"fb8ee339dd41" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.14SF-14:MarketingPipeline">3.14 SF-14: Marketing Pipeline</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"be=
b5b9980e65" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9d2b45fc4cfa">
<th data-local-id=3D"0296348457d8" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"75d6917dcec8">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"b831e8b07ca1" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"4d3e3b531b26">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5531b2e90db6">
<td data-local-id=3D"67e9902c48e2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ef1bfed86676"><strong>Priority</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1132fc874f7d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"400009db250e">[P3] Medium</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h4 local-id=3D"7a33f9769519" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-3.14.1FunctionalRequirements">3.14.1 Functional Requirements</h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"50=
cb44102c24" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"93d587e43c67">
<th data-local-id=3D"0bdb3b56650d" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"041bedf3860b">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"44136ea3cab2" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fee499d4a81e">Priority</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"934f08d5bc96" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"379354671054">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"da2ef09eb29b">
<td data-local-id=3D"d4fd623434f3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1636959633a0">REQ-MKT-001</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a9bf4af513d8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c4094c85733b">[P3]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"51be5e2b225d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"301343fac904">System SHALL allow marketing coordinators to c=
reate content briefs: product SKU, video type (Tutorial, Review, Repair Gui=
de, Demo), target publish date.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"21b1d763b7a3">
<td data-local-id=3D"5cf125c50e9c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d7303b584d54">REQ-MKT-002</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0978b2c1a1d7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d55537e7e3cd">[P3]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2872f2e8928c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"adf03fc3ea66">System SHALL track production stages: Brief =
=E2=86=92 Filming =E2=86=92 Editing =E2=86=92 Review =E2=86=92 Published.</=
p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b730cce639a7">
<td data-local-id=3D"2cd6995c9a1b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bd78a2b88df2">REQ-MKT-003</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"01d87fa96f36" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"649b75240886">[P3]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a46496c8ae31" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d48f4367510a">Upon publishing, system SHALL store the YouTub=
e video URL and associate it with the linked SKU in the product catalog.</p=
></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"34ce2465e52f">
<td data-local-id=3D"dc48d6828774" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8a6142f8a51">REQ-MKT-004</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f8e5f5c125ba" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7b0ce9036832">[P3]</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a50e68f80e07" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"684fb5b823a1">Customer support agents SHALL be able to retri=
eve video links from the product detail page to share with customers.</p></=
td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"d7b0c52b0561">
<h2 local-id=3D"6cdaa1dec66c" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-4.DataRequirements=E2=80=93SchemaReference">4. Data Requirements =E2=80=
=93 Schema Reference</h2>
<p local-id=3D"398e5ec7e715">This section documents the complete data model=
. Column definitions are sourced directly from the production ORM code (<co=
de>entities.py</code> and <code>schema.ts</code>). Column names prefixed wi=
th curly braces (<code>{column}</code>) indicate actual database column nam=
es.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"65d8a18d2933" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-4.1Domain:ProductCatalog">4.1 Domain: Product Catalog</h3>
<p local-id=3D"0ebda284b04e"><strong>Entity Relationship (simplified):</str=
ong></p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">brand (=
1) =E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=
=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 (N) product_family
product_family (1) =E2=94=80=E2=94=80 (N) product_identity
product_identity (1) =E2=94=80 (N) product_variant
product_identity (N) =E2=94=80=E2=94=80 (M) bundle_component =E2=94=80=E2=
=94=80 (N) product_identity  [parent=E2=80=93child]
product_family (1) =E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 (N) lci_definition
product_variant (1) =E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 (N) platform_listing
product_variant (1) =E2=94=80=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 (N) inventory_item</pre>
</div>
</div>
