<hr local-id=3D"38f463644ba3">
<h2 local-id=3D"fd5c2d2673a9" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-5.ExternalInterfaceRequirements">5. External Interface Requirements</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"d8a6c967c686" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-5.1UserInterfaces">5.1 User Interfaces</h3>
<p local-id=3D"5824a9ac0bb9"><strong>UI-01: Warehouse Station Kiosk (Mobile=
-Optimized)</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"9cc1886cc3e1">
<li local-id=3D"c5ae06c6b95c">
<p local-id=3D"f8ff277550f1">Optimized for 10-inch tablets mounted at each =
station.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8b10cbb3e6e0">
<p local-id=3D"83bb467904a8">PIN-based login. Session auto-locks after 5 mi=
nutes of inactivity.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e2eb013a4e47">
<p local-id=3D"7bd89caee99f">Receiving Station: Large barcode scan target, =
lot confirmation, label print button.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dd11d62c193c">
<p local-id=3D"859f7449e9f1">Tech Station: Diagnostic checklist with tap-to=
-confirm steps, photo upload, grade selector.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"efd8abb4c1e7">
<p local-id=3D"79fe7266199d">Packing Station: Order item checklist, scan co=
nfirmation, weight display, label print button.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d8e99b6e1060"><strong>UI-02: Desktop Operations Portal</stro=
ng></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d383b6a39597">
<li local-id=3D"9ea2dea7059e">
<p local-id=3D"8fbe6e3dac4b">Web app (Next.js) accessible via desktop brows=
er.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"120430654321">
<p local-id=3D"d09a71251c39">SSO login. Multi-tenant support (organization =
switching).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5250bffbbac7">
<p local-id=3D"8fc7fe72640f">Dashboard: Order status summary, listing healt=
h alerts, sync status for all platforms.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"92d04e365192">
<p local-id=3D"8bfefbbabfc1">Listing Management: Grid view of all listings =
across all accounts with health status badges.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"02e477bd7ecb">
<p local-id=3D"42daa21a81d9">Order Management: Order list with filter by pl=
atform, status, date range. Click-through to order detail.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1cbdca1ff393">
<p local-id=3D"a529446b65d5">Customer record view with order history and li=
nked inventory items.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d279bb43eb8d"><strong>UI-03: FastAPI ERP Admin Interface</st=
rong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"406109de22e5">
<li local-id=3D"3cf4bcb81318">
<p local-id=3D"f42925196277">Primary for Listing Manager / Data Admin and S=
ystem Administrator roles.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ac3b6b7be11">
<p local-id=3D"7f030c08c6ef">Product catalog CRUD (family =E2=86=92 identit=
y =E2=86=92 variant tree).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2c460bce2908">
<p local-id=3D"a77d62d8a83d">Zoho sync status dashboard: per-entity sync st=
atus, error review, manual retry.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e3a8a039bc10">
<p local-id=3D"6cef1d7c36da">Platform listing management: external_ref_id r=
esolution, sync_status board.</p></li>
</ul>
