n-5.2HardwareInterfaces">5.2 Hardware Interfaces</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"8c=
3fbde9a02e" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2f98f6f3bba6">
<th data-local-id=3D"b7c31b2ea9cf" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b11b0d0375e3">Device</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"0f6f013a1fb9" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"da92a2e99529">Interface Method</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"52c609b6f9f1" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"679561166783">Notes</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bd7b4776f086">
<td data-local-id=3D"5f92d97b017d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"45c8cbf3e7f2">Barcode Scanner (USB/Bluetooth)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"122560443c05" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0e552f46f184">HID keyboard emulation</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2a99befb765d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"429c2360497e">Scans input as keystrokes into active input fi=
eld. No driver needed.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"88b59fac7f37">
<td data-local-id=3D"fb9324685021" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"91fe9f16d969">Postal Scale</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1345865067df" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e98a2ee1f3c1">USB HID or RS-232 serial</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1f3ddfc0cfaf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5e9feb6cd6f1">Weight is read via browser Web Serial API or a=
 local bridge service.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e34ebbd13c87">
<td data-local-id=3D"d60ba8e3724a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"48e054e9122b">Label Printer (Zebra / Dymo)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6b3d386334df" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5562135bcfdd">Network TCP/IP or USB</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"247e59c14738" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"598327d191c1">Label jobs sent as ZPL or EPL commands. Browse=
r Print Plugin used for direct printing.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d317a202ff90">
<td data-local-id=3D"c23ff14f490f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"532dd35381b8">CCTV NVR System</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6b596a1c5098" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"00b177581852">HTTP Deep-link / REST API</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9c4f8db6947d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"60d44f7a4303">NVR exposes a URL template: <code>&lt;http://n=
vr.local/playback?cam=3D{camera_id}&amp;t=3D{unix_ts}</code>&gt;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"783f3ea79ff0">
<td data-local-id=3D"7c786b90dc28" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"55fa33182260">Synology NAS (Photo storage)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dbb7d1a82925" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d3d74b18864">HTTP/HTTPS REST API</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3148b8753d28" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2ef62b336969">Photos uploaded via Synology API. URLs stored =
in JSONB fields in the database.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
