<td data-local-id=3D"5c6e41f13c2d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"56354545e687">OAuth 2.0 LWA (Login with Amazon). Refresh tok=
en encrypted in <code>amazon_accounts.{access_token}</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
