<p local-id=3D"4a10bb5c7244">150 API calls/day on free plan. Higher on paid=
 plans. Implement Zoho rate-limit headers.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"f429f2c5d68c"><strong>Operations:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"325e1b79c90f">
<li local-id=3D"1cb7dba85506">
<p local-id=3D"7de7089b0685">POST /api/v1/items (create product)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dd85d66f089d">
<p local-id=3D"df99f2f0f9fa">PUT /api/v1/items/{item_id} (update product)</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c3b16c5548f5">
<p local-id=3D"dd44932c9ab7">POST /api/v1/salesorders (create sales order)<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"60179f9dd713">
<p local-id=3D"ddb390a58273">PUT /api/v1/contacts/{contact_id} (update cust=
omer)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e6d753425be7">
<p local-id=3D"b348c03fa553">Webhook: item.update / salesorder.created (inb=
ound sync)</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"1ea23819ce4a" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-5.3.7CarrierAPIs(UPS,USPS,FedEx)">5.3.7 Carrier APIs (UPS, USPS, FedEx)</=
h4>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"26=
febc3647f3" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"aa63430b74a8">
<th data-local-id=3D"3234fff4e029" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"014120e38e58">Field</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"03685e65580b" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8d904946749f">Detail</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1af4b24b4c2d">
<td data-local-id=3D"6c148528ec42" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"52e0e1d67cda"><strong>Accounts</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"940465aad089" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ce04c48b9364">One account per carrier</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"030d3e99eee4">
<td data-local-id=3D"ae5b1e61e3e9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fa0fa086a237"><strong>Auth Method</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"03be874a30d6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"06cb6c39e0c6">UPS: Client ID + Secret (OAuth 2.0). USPS: OAu=
th 2.0. FedEx: Client ID + Secret.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3e02867a0a95">
<td data-local-id=3D"533bb1b4f4cb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"147c4d647e50"><strong>Rate Limits</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b17a6bfd8a95" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b383eb8a6707">No hard daily limit for standard label volume.=
 Monitor for transient failures.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"efdb9f1d5519"><strong>Operations:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b16dcba644f2">
<li local-id=3D"614344b2e2f4">
<p local-id=3D"b11374172e8f">POST /shipments (label generation with weight =
+ dimensions)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"447bed88c7ad">
<p local-id=3D"c3fcdd90d9ee">GET /track/v1/details/{tracking_number} (statu=
s check)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ae13df1233a">
<p local-id=3D"e6deaa138a4a">Webhook: delivery event callbacks</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"5ce9b968d3fd">
<h2 local-id=3D"6017980c9cd6" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-6.Non-FunctionalRequirements">6. Non-Functional Requirements</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"3ff61d9e6d69" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-6.1Performance">6.1 Performance</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"8e=
acec0cfa33" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1529e819829a">
<th data-local-id=3D"f1e9e7937820" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"60e0be4bfbc2">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"8d1edbb3aa8b" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"59ff2f3276f1">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1749392a4684">
<td data-local-id=3D"828d677b6145" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"38449c277868">NFR-P-01</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e3f6987f0f62" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5785f127eb47">Inventory quantity changes SHALL propagate to =
all active channel listings within =E2=89=A4 5 minutes of a stock mutation =
event (SOLD, RECEIVED, RMA).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9ad08fdc0229">
<td data-local-id=3D"3b577e28d102" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"341d5b6ab623">NFR-P-02</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"34aa0dd4ab4b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c89ccb68004e">Warehouse station UIs (Receiving, Tech, Packin=
g) SHALL respond to all user interactions within =E2=89=A4 1 second under n=
ormal load (=E2=89=A4 10 concurrent station sessions).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"da2987980f7b">
<td data-local-id=3D"bc6f46b7af0d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b97e5ca26589">NFR-P-03</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"11e22d116741" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"811902412d50">The Unified Support Inbox SHALL load the first=
 page (50 messages) within =E2=89=A4 2 seconds.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d005cd996f40">
<td data-local-id=3D"a9106920b280" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ca7403b86c34">NFR-P-04</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"99b59598345d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b15aab8e6e5f">Order ingestion from any single platform SHALL=
 complete a full 15-minute sync window within =E2=89=A4 3 minutes.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e311a35d20f6">
<td data-local-id=3D"317f7a1729d0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"03364ce2a73a">NFR-P-05</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a61bc4b4fc9d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0a1efd2f521a">Product catalog search (by SKU, UPIS-H, or nam=
e) SHALL return results within =E2=89=A4 500 ms for catalogs up to 50,000 v=
ariants.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"351cf153c2e2" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-6.2Security">6.2 Security</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"69=
8b3911bde0" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"be44f5ddebd7">
<th data-local-id=3D"15a0a9ae847f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"15e09d4d5ccb">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"c9bb69ab1b05" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0ef43d0656f0">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d4be3e00abd6">
<td data-local-id=3D"0c31414e94eb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fb0f18fab087">NFR-S-01</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1cd92b0b40cb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8edea22e174a">All OAuth access tokens and refresh tokens sto=
red in <code>ebay_accounts</code> and <code>amazon_accounts</code> SHALL be=
 encrypted at rest using AES-256-GCM. Plaintext tokens are never persisted.=
</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3c9017a71c05">
<td data-local-id=3D"e21f7f23f03b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8c9a45c53d61">NFR-S-02</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c4fea56625cf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"52dfbc576e54">All API endpoints SHALL require valid authenti=
cation (JWT or session cookie). Unauthenticated requests receive HTTP 401.<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ccc50529704f">
<td data-local-id=3D"187d0c6eeb58" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d0b224565c77">NFR-S-03</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ad3b14ccafdc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eca98dedd93b">RBAC SHALL be enforced on every API endpoint. =
Insufficient role/permission requests receive HTTP 403.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"942bfa3c7fe3">
<td data-local-id=3D"a1f97c66cf09" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"06ca061620a3">NFR-S-04</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0f6908a6e916" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1e478f3fa8e3">CCTV footage access SHALL be logged in a secur=
ity audit log with staff ID, role, order ID, timestamp, and outcome. Logs a=
re immutable.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"00859faffc4e">
<td data-local-id=3D"858dc12a0472" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"60d42b10bebc">NFR-S-05</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"61c4cbd38b29" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"49ef1e789fd4">PIN hashes SHALL use bcrypt with cost factor =
=E2=89=A5 12. No plaintext PIN is ever stored or logged.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"78ec68780e01">
<td data-local-id=3D"9d1cba15dce3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a4e1123180dd">NFR-S-06</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f60cbbe09a91" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e4389596b403">All data in transit SHALL use TLS 1.2 or highe=
r. TLS 1.0 and 1.1 are explicitly disabled.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bd2cc9123cb1">
<td data-local-id=3D"092951354568" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"074d0f967e1b">NFR-S-07</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e6ed3cdf7c8c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8831510d3597">PostgreSQL RLS policies SHALL prevent cross-te=
nant data access at the database layer. Application-layer tenant checks are=
 a secondary control.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"39cf20baf78d">
<td data-local-id=3D"f692e15ac4f3" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8469fd11b57">NFR-S-08</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"89a840738871" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8c6751ce4ff4">Sensitive admin actions (bulk price change, cr=
edential vault update, mass delist) SHALL require re-authentication (step-u=
p auth) within the current session.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"4654232f0c63" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-6.3Reliability&amp;Availability">6.3 Reliability &amp; Availability</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"cb=
70d56ebf64" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"20b2878f968d">
<th data-local-id=3D"607b35bf903a" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"6389277f58cc">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"8ed52a580bc4" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d2ec1c635952">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"789f6d4e0a69">
<td data-local-id=3D"2f3e5235ee21" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5747e4eb039c">NFR-R-01</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6da35945a032" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a9e440d043d6">System SHALL maintain =E2=89=A5 99.5% uptime d=
uring warehouse operating hours (07:00=E2=80=9322:00 local time, Mon=E2=80=
=93Sat).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5cb5a9992e10">
<td data-local-id=3D"ecbd9b803ccf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b9e51e2b3f98">NFR-R-02</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b9ad956f24cf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fbf222fd7bf1">Background platform sync jobs SHALL implement =
exponential backoff with jitter on API failures. Maximum 5 retries before m=
arking <code>integration_state.current_status</code> =3D ERROR.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1fbf40410bdf">
<td data-local-id=3D"f51425a1e7f9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eb53a005a146">NFR-R-03</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8b8d7d3876ba" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c641297bc9af">Warehouse station kiosks SHALL support a grace=
ful offline mode: scans are cached locally for up to 60 minutes if server c=
onnectivity is lost, and uploaded on reconnect.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"24b48c6f2edd">
<td data-local-id=3D"287204686957" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"623c1d11a251">NFR-R-04</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"01b835d4adee" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d5ceda170c6a">Database backups SHALL be performed daily. Rec=
overy Point Objective (RPO) =3D 24 hours. Recovery Time Objective (RTO) =3D=
 4 hours.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"38bb61968373" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-6.4Scalability">6.4 Scalability</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"53=
3d182fb72e" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"333c342dc4a7">
<th data-local-id=3D"7db4daaf31db" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"0e2713a97c91">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"bf9a0ad4fdde" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"425b2fd8e3ad">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"335ad67b8070">
<td data-local-id=3D"bc7b751df078" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"682dd9d639a8">NFR-SC-01</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c6a3c80c53fb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fb4cb1aa5d39">The system SHALL support up to 15 concurrent m=
arketplace accounts without architectural changes.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"49065e27f147">
<td data-local-id=3D"8f67c7f4915b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7236b5513b7e">NFR-SC-02</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"44cbd6c78dd0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1846056c1918">The stock ledger (inventory_item) SHALL suppor=
t up to 50,000 items and 10,000 status mutation events per day without perf=
ormance degradation.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cffc2a03088e">
<td data-local-id=3D"0d93d0de4ad9" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d5900711b92e">NFR-SC-03</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0db636d2b7f5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2bbb79f350ad">The order import pipeline SHALL be horizontall=
y scalable by adding additional worker processes without code changes (work=
er pool pattern).</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"49749e99883a" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-6.5DataIntegrity">6.5 Data Integrity</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"20=
463109bd55" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"65a0efbdce57">
<th data-local-id=3D"3f99377d8cde" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"a5366e959094">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"7ada2d3a2d57" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"9faf323f2b04">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cb922734acc2">
<td data-local-id=3D"1f9adcda0bed" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ef9b70f91cb9">NFR-D-01</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e3b71b01c743" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"26cb5f89c6b6"><code>product_identity.{generated_upis_h}</cod=
e> and <code>{hex_signature}</code> are IMMUTABLE after row creation. Appli=
cation and migration code must never UPDATE these columns.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"fad5473e9462">
<td data-local-id=3D"6635261dea3a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f3992a5c7cca">NFR-D-02</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0a4f47efd479" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4cee9d542fd1">Order import SHALL be idempotent. The <code>UN=
IQUE(platform, external_order_id)</code> constraint on <code>orders</code> =
enforces this at the database level.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"204e80534bcd">
<td data-local-id=3D"29bc9808e381" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eeb630385f53">NFR-D-03</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"60de3fd0c5aa" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f99bbc5f846f"><code>inventory_item.{cost_basis}</code> must =
satisfy <code>cost_basis &gt;=3D 0</code> (enforced by <code>ck_inventory_p=
ositive_cost</code>). Negative cost basis is a data entry error.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e4e2ec60d043">
<td data-local-id=3D"46196abe7084" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b6c49a9d25b4">NFR-D-04</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c429db212c35" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e329580b41db"><code>order_item.{quantity}</code> must be &gt=
; 0 (enforced by <code>ck_order_item_positive_quantity</code>). Zero-quanti=
ty line items are invalid.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2e15453c5cfe">
<td data-local-id=3D"53957c98ce03" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5997246daf55">NFR-D-05</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"94abbbd67c51" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5e34c8ec03a6">All tables SHALL carry <code>{created_at}</cod=
e> and <code>{updated_at}</code> timestamps auto-managed by the database. A=
pplication code must not manually set these.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b61e4f207c80">
<td data-local-id=3D"213640df3771" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2d1d42fa94ed">NFR-D-06</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"abeade050b08" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c6b2614a228b">Zoho sync echo-loops SHALL be prevented by the=
 SHA-256 hash check (<code>{zoho_last_sync_hash}</code>). A sync is only di=
spatched if the payload hash differs from the stored hash.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"fff6f6005cc6" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-6.6Auditability">6.6 Auditability</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"1a=
e2e3c233b9" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"139c61ef07b5">
<th data-local-id=3D"4cb04baf2dd0" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"aabcdc43b3aa">Req ID</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a0c117c4b675" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7bf5f4eb8b9a">Requirement</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4e09a4c93386">
<td data-local-id=3D"e27cc903439e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f5adc18d7d16">NFR-A-01</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b02d25f1778a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7cc637d1379e">All CREATE, UPDATE, DELETE operations on order=
, order_item, inventory_item, and platform_listing tables SHALL be recorded=
 in an audit log table with: table name, row ID, operation type, old values=
 (JSONB), new values (JSONB), staff ID, and timestamp.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e2d5a50bade4">
<td data-local-id=3D"ddc7963729ce" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"466463357266">NFR-A-02</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f5f6b70d05be" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"74860b7c3ad7">CCTV footage access attempts SHALL be logged w=
ith outcome. Logs SHALL be retained for a minimum of 365 days.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a451f826b8ba">
<td data-local-id=3D"9f0f7823df00" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4503391093ce">NFR-A-03</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"73575857039c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"19cb9abe918b">Packing session logs (<code>packer_logs</code>=
) SHALL be retained for a minimum of 180 days to support dispute resolution=
.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0fe664a81b58">
<td data-local-id=3D"a1871400eea6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"52b9dcfe7eca">NFR-A-04</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ccc78bc18599" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4453df22ab59"><code>physical_scans</code> records SHALL be r=
etained for 90 days.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr local-id=3D"85eb31c2c304">
<h2 local-id=3D"4bd364db36ff" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-7.Constraints&amp;Compliance">7. Constraints &amp; Compliance</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"d5fe3b214ca0" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-7.1TechnicalConstraints">7.1 Technical Constraints</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"c45e272545af">
<li local-id=3D"1b92a4a75935">
<p local-id=3D"97597e417e62">The FastAPI ERP stack must be deployable via D=
ocker Compose. Docker and Docker Compose v2+ are required on the production=
 host.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1cc6a8c8ba6d">
<p local-id=3D"a72703904c5f">The Warehouse Portal must be deployable to Ver=
cel. No server-side processes beyond Next.js API routes and edge functions.=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d83c1725dc58">
<p local-id=3D"baca2bf77798">PostgreSQL 15+ is the only supported database =
engine. MySQL and SQLite are not supported due to JSONB and RLS requirement=
s.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d68e9cff10a5">
<p local-id=3D"d8a3db12b8ec">Node.js 20 LTS is the minimum runtime for the =
Warehouse Portal.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7b41c80c1978">
<p local-id=3D"6b0275950604">Python 3.11+ is the minimum runtime for the Fa=
stAPI ERP.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"56814294c8b5">
<p local-id=3D"eacb043cc685">Redis 7+ is required for the sync job queue. N=
o alternative queue backend is supported without code changes.</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"007b124dc0d2" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-7.2BusinessConstraints">7.2 Business Constraints</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"8b39d4b34b09">
<li local-id=3D"48891ec698fc">
<p local-id=3D"e6365be8fd16">The system must comply with eBay Developer Pro=
gram Agreement. Any use of eBay API data outside the terms (e.g., storing u=
ser data beyond permitted period) is prohibited.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2a3e4bc264b9">
<p local-id=3D"744d9673eded">The system must comply with Amazon SP-API Acce=
ptable Use Policy. PII from Amazon orders must not be used for marketing pu=
rposes.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3d86d6de6599">
<p local-id=3D"727f3e328f0a">Customer PII (name, email, address) from all p=
latforms must be stored with appropriate access controls and must not be sh=
ared with third parties beyond Zoho (the designated accounting system).</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"37045c68d89b">
<p local-id=3D"f5c7a40d0969">CCTV footage is accessed by deep-link only. Th=
e ERP does not store, transcode, or proxy video streams. The NVR system is =
independently maintained.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1073f45ad1ad">
<p local-id=3D"6db3d34c8707">Zoho Inventory remains the system of record fo=
r accounting. The ERP syncs to Zoho; it does not replace Zoho for financial=
 reporting.</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"e3222094ece0" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-7.3Regulatory">7.3 Regulatory</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"f3f74ed694c3">
<li local-id=3D"c4ea61784fd6">
<p local-id=3D"252e9cae9626">CCPA: California Consumer Privacy Act complian=
ce for handling California resident customer data.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e4db51721371">
<p local-id=3D"766b8458db0d">GDPR: If any EU customer data is stored, GDPR =
Article 17 (right to erasure) must be supportable via a data deletion workf=
low.</p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"a37273954192">
<h2 local-id=3D"0d8db13e9496" id=3D"USAVERPSoftwareRequirementsSpecificatio=
n-8.Appendices">8. Appendices</h2>
